(62, 'BBQ Baby Back Ribs', 'Fall-off-the-bone pork ribs glazed with smoky BBQ sauce.', '1. Remove membrane from ribs. 2. Rub with spice mix. 3. Wrap in foil, bake at 150°C for 2.5 hours. 4. Unwrap, brush with BBQ sauce. 5. Grill for 10 mins until caramelized.', 20, 160, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/d259dd4c-2cd0-42d6-983f-4e1fcc0b5b21.jpg', 'approved', '2026-04-30 23:05:43', '2026-04-30 23:21:53', 3, 0),
(63, 'Caesar Salad', 'Crisp romaine lettuce with classic Caesar dressing and croutons.', '1. Tear romaine into pieces. 2. Whisk together mayo, lemon juice, garlic, anchovies, and parmesan for dressing. 3. Toss lettuce with dressing. 4. Top with croutons and extra parmesan.', 15, 5, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/b1bc6084-bba1-4876-bc5b-eeff270a7afc.jpg', 'approved', '2026-04-30 23:08:22', '2026-04-30 23:21:51', 3, 0),
(64, 'Chicken Pot Pie', 'Comforting creamy chicken and vegetable filling in a flaky pastry crust.', 'Cook diced chicken with onions and garlic. Add carrots, peas, and potatoes. Stir in cream of chicken soup and broth. Pour into pie dish with pastry base. Cover with pastry lid, cut vents. Bake at 200°C for 35 mins.', 25, 45, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/70f2877d-8456-4783-935e-1f4767522147.jpg', 'approved', '2026-04-30 23:12:15', '2026-06-26 17:20:56', 3, 0),
(65, 'New York Cheesecake', 'Rich and creamy classic baked cheesecake with a graham cracker crust.', '1. Mix crushed graham crackers with butter, press into pan. 2. Beat cream cheese, sugar, and vanilla until smooth. 3. Add eggs one at a time. 4. Pour over crust. 5. Bake at 160°C for 55 mins. 6. Cool completely, then refrigerate overnight.', 30, 50, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/69a04ead-1613-4a3c-b25c-6679b145a37e.jpg', 'approved', '2026-04-30 23:15:44', '2026-04-30 23:21:47', 3, 0),
(66, 'French Onion Soup', 'Slow-cooked caramelized onion soup topped with melted Gruyère toast.', 'Caramelize sliced onions in butter for 40 mins. Deglaze with white wine. Add beef broth, thyme, and bay leaf. Simmer 20 mins. Ladle into bowls, top with baguette slice and Gruyère. Broil until cheese is bubbly.', 15, 60, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/7e71f9b5-589e-4a27-a02e-36711a8031f2.jpg', 'approved', '2026-04-30 23:21:01', '2026-04-30 23:21:45', 3, 0),
(67, 'Mapo Tofu', 'Mapo Tofu is a Chinese-style dish prepared with tofu, ground pork, and doubanjiang. It is a bold and spicy recipe suitable for rice pairing.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Mapo Tofu. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat a wok and stir-fry ground pork until cooked. Add doubanjiang, garlic, and ginger and sauté until fragrant. Add tofu cubes and broth and simmer gently. Thicken with cornstarch slurry, drizzle with Sichuan pepper oil, and garnish with scallion. Serve Mapo Tofu hot and enjoy.', 15, 20, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/6cf0735d-146e-4bcc-8534-da746e10eb02.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 12:36:10', '2026-06-18 00:00:48', 1, 0),
(68, 'Steamed Fish with Ginger and Scallion', 'Steamed Fish with Ginger and Scallion is a Chinese-style dish prepared with white fish, ginger, and scallion. It is a light and fragrant recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Steamed Fish with Ginger and Scallion. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Score the fish and stuff with ginger slices. Steam over high heat for 10–12 minutes until fully cooked. Lay scallion strips over the fish, drizzle with hot oil and soy sauce to finish. Serve Steamed Fish with Ginger and Scallion hot and enjoy.', 10, 15, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/7721abbd-0bfc-42ea-ac73-73dced5c4023.png', 'approved', '2026-06-17 12:44:11', '2026-06-18 00:00:53', 1, 0),
(69, 'Red-Braised Pork Belly', 'Red-Braised Pork Belly is a Chinese-style dish prepared with pork belly, soy sauce, Shaoxing wine, and rock sugar. It is a rich and savory recipe suitable for festive occasions.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Red-Braised Pork Belly. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blanch pork belly in boiling water and drain. Caramelize rock sugar in a pot, add pork belly and coat evenly. Pour in soy sauce, Shaoxing wine, and water, then braise on low heat for 60–75 minutes until tender and glossy. Serve Red-Braised Pork Belly hot and enjoy.', 15, 80, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/2ccc469e-783d-44cf-92bd-49fd06fc8c83.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 12:50:44', '2026-06-18 00:00:03', 1, 0),
(70, 'Hot and Sour Soup', 'Hot and Sour Soup is a Chinese-style dish prepared with tofu, woodear, egg, vinegar, and white pepper. It is a tangy and warming recipe suitable for cold days.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Hot and Sour Soup. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Bring broth to a boil and add woodear, tofu strips, and bamboo shoots. Stir in soy sauce, vinegar, and white pepper. Drizzle beaten egg slowly while stirring to form ribbons. Thicken with cornstarch slurry and garnish with scallion. Serve Hot and Sour Soup hot and enjoy.', 15, 15, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/c423c5d3-8e2a-463f-b77f-db442b592a22.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 13:00:24', '2026-06-18 00:00:38', 1, 0),
(71, 'Char Siu Pork', 'Char Siu Pork is a Chinese-style dish prepared with pork shoulder, hoisin sauce, honey, and five-spice powder. It is a sweet and smoky recipe suitable for rice or noodle pairing.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Char Siu Pork. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Marinate pork strips in hoisin sauce, honey, soy sauce, and five-spice powder for at least 4 hours or overnight. Roast in an oven at 200°C, basting with marinade midway, until caramelised and cooked through. Rest for 5 minutes and slice before serving. Serve Char Siu Pork hot and enjoy.', 20, 35, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/8afcb996-d2d3-454a-8945-68ca06121e1a.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 16:12:38', '2026-06-18 00:00:45', 1, 0),
(72, 'Dan Dan Noodles', 'Dan Dan Noodles is a Chinese-style dish prepared with wheat noodles, ground pork, Sichuan pepper, chilli oil, and sesame paste. It is a spicy and nutty recipe suitable for a quick meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Dan Dan Noodles. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cook noodles until al dente and drain. Stir-fry ground pork with soy sauce and Sichuan pepper until crispy. Mix sesame paste, chilli oil, vinegar, and soy sauce to form the sauce. Toss noodles with sauce, top with pork, crushed peanut, and scallion. Serve Dan Dan Noodles hot and enjoy.', 15, 15, 2, 'medium', '/images/recipes/e6198e1b-ef35-44a0-a573-e4379d9549ad.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 16:21:06', '2026-06-18 00:00:51', 1, 0),
(73, 'Stir-Fried Water Spinach with Garlic', 'Stir-Fried Water Spinach with Garlic is a Chinese-style dish prepared with water spinach, garlic, and fermented tofu. It is a simple and aromatic recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Stir-Fried Water Spinach with Garlic. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat a wok until smoking and add oil. Stir-fry garlic and fermented tofu until fragrant. Add water spinach and toss on high heat until wilted. Season with salt and serve immediately. Serve Stir-Fried Water Spinach with Garlic hot and enjoy.', 5, 5, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/fe694e9b-2122-436b-839d-35d77064e84f.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 16:30:39', '2026-06-18 00:00:29', 1, 0),
(74, 'Wonton Soup', 'Wonton Soup is a Chinese-style dish prepared with minced pork, shrimp, wonton wrappers, and clear broth. It is a light and comforting recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Wonton Soup. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Mix minced pork and shrimp with soy sauce, sesame oil, and ginger. Wrap filling in wonton wrappers and seal edges with water. Boil wontons in water until they float and are cooked through, about 5–6 minutes. Ladle into warm chicken broth and garnish with scallion and sesame oil. Serve Wonton Soup hot and enjoy.', 30, 15, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/6c2b5b04-8d1b-4e17-9bad-879c0eeb8beb.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 16:38:09', '2026-06-18 00:00:42', 1, 0),
(75, 'Steamed Pork Ribs with Black Bean Sauce', 'Steamed Pork Ribs with Black Bean Sauce is a Chinese-style dish prepared with pork ribs, fermented black beans, garlic, and chilli. It is a savory and tender recipe suitable for dim sum or rice pairing.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Steamed Pork Ribs with Black Bean Sauce. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Marinate pork ribs with fermented black beans, garlic, soy sauce, oyster sauce, and chilli for at least 30 minutes. Arrange on a plate and steam over high heat for 20–25 minutes until fully cooked and tender. Garnish with scallion. Serve Steamed Pork Ribs with Black Bean Sauce hot and enjoy.', 35, 25, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/b027cd3d-a2dd-4607-8fe0-2f0820648ac2.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 16:46:37', '2026-06-17 23:59:57', 1, 0),
(76, 'Egg Drop Soup with Corn', 'Egg Drop Soup with Corn is a Chinese-style dish prepared with egg, corn, and chicken broth. It is a smooth and sweet recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Egg Drop Soup with Corn. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Bring chicken broth to a boil and add corn kernels. Thicken with cornstarch slurry and stir well. Slowly pour beaten egg into the simmering broth while stirring gently to create soft egg ribbons. Season with salt and white pepper and garnish with scallion. Serve Egg Drop Soup with Corn hot and enjoy.', 5, 10, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/94980f05-09cb-452f-bc5a-4123d5cc8160.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 17:07:42', '2026-06-17 23:59:54', 1, 0),
(77, 'Mushroom Risotto', 'Mushroom Risotto is a Western-style dish prepared with Arborio rice, mixed mushrooms, white wine, and parmesan. It is a creamy and earthy recipe suitable for a comforting dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Mushroom Risotto. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Warm the broth in a separate saucepan and keep on low heat. Sauté onion and garlic in butter until soft, then add mushrooms and cook until golden. Add Arborio rice and toast for 2 minutes. Pour in white wine and stir until absorbed. Add warm broth one ladle at a time, stirring constantly and waiting until each addition is absorbed before adding the next, for about 20 minutes. Stir in butter and parmesan, season with salt and pepper, and garnish with fresh thyme. Serve Mushroom Risotto hot and enjoy.', 15, 30, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/16ceff22-0be0-42b5-9353-e3a86890ad93.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 17:53:58', '2026-06-18 00:00:26', 1, 0);
INSERT INTO `recipes` (`recipe_id`, `title`, `description`, `instructions`, `prep_time`, `cook_time`, `servings`, `difficulty`, `image_url`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `is_duplicate_suspected`) VALUES
(78, 'Beef Stew', 'Beef Stew is a Western-style dish prepared with beef chuck, potato, carrot, and red wine. It is a hearty and warming recipe suitable for cold days.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Beef Stew. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Season beef chunks with salt and pepper and sear in batches in a heavy pot until browned on all sides, then set aside. Sauté onion, garlic, and celery in the same pot until softened. Add tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, then deglaze with red wine. Return beef to the pot, add broth, thyme, and bay leaves, and bring to a boil. Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 1.5 hours. Add potato and carrot and continue cooking for 30 minutes until vegetables are tender and broth has thickened. Remove bay leaves, adjust seasoning, and garnish with fresh parsley. Serve Beef Stew hot and enjoy.', 20, 120, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/f596430f-598e-4eed-8aa6-84a7461f89e3.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:08:26', '2026-06-18 00:00:40', 1, 0),
(79, 'Margherita Pizza', 'Margherita Pizza is a Western-style dish prepared with pizza dough, tomato sauce, fresh mozzarella, and basil. It is a classic and simple recipe suitable for family meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Margherita Pizza. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Stretch or roll the pizza dough into a thin round on a floured surface. Spread tomato sauce evenly over the base, leaving a border for the crust. Tear fresh mozzarella and scatter over the sauce, then drizzle with olive oil. Bake in a preheated oven at 240°C for 10–12 minutes until the crust is golden and the cheese is bubbling. Remove from oven, scatter fresh basil leaves on top, and drizzle with extra olive oil. Serve Margherita Pizza hot and enjoy.', 20, 12, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/f52e3e59-e89a-4ec8-8561-1364adb02cce.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:12:10', '2026-06-18 00:00:00', 1, 0),
(80, 'Eggs Benedict', 'Eggs Benedict is a Western-style dish prepared with poached eggs, Canadian bacon, English muffin, and hollandaise sauce. It is a rich and indulgent recipe suitable for brunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Eggs Benedict. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Make the hollandaise sauce by whisking egg yolks with lemon juice over a double boiler until thick, then slowly whisk in melted butter and season with salt and cayenne. Toast the English muffins and warm the Canadian bacon in a pan. Bring a pot of water to a gentle simmer, add a splash of vinegar, and poach the eggs for 3–4 minutes until the whites are set but yolks are still runny. Place bacon on each muffin half, top with a poached egg, and spoon hollandaise generously over the top. Garnish with paprika and chives. Serve Eggs Benedict immediately and enjoy.', 20, 15, 2, 'hard', '/images/recipes/9117c0e1-9474-4eb6-b7a1-1be1978c8e7b.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:17:22', '2026-06-18 00:00:44', 1, 0),
(81, 'Clam Chowder with Bacon', 'Clam Chowder is a Western-style dish prepared with clams, potato, cream, and bacon. It is a thick and comforting recipe suitable for a hearty lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Clam Chowder. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cook bacon in a large pot until crispy, then remove and set aside, leaving the fat in the pot. Sauté onion and celery in the bacon fat until softened. Add diced potato, clam juice, and broth, and simmer until potato is tender, about 15 minutes. Stir in clams and heavy cream and heat through without boiling. Season with salt, pepper, and thyme. Ladle into bowls and top with crispy bacon and fresh chives. Serve Clam Chowder hot and enjoy.', 15, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/7f702b06-f2f9-4daa-b8ec-364f0d7fab37.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:22:35', '2026-06-18 00:00:34', 1, 0),
(82, 'Rack of Lamb with Herb Crust', 'Rack of Lamb with Herb Crust is a Western-style dish prepared with lamb rack, breadcrumbs, rosemary, and Dijon mustard. It is an elegant and flavorful recipe suitable for special occasions.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Rack of Lamb with Herb Crust. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Season the lamb rack generously with salt and pepper and sear in a hot oven-proof pan with oil until browned on all sides. Remove from heat and brush the meaty side with Dijon mustard. Mix breadcrumbs with chopped rosemary, thyme, parsley, and garlic, then press the herb mixture firmly onto the mustard-coated lamb. Roast in a preheated oven at 200°C for 20–25 minutes for medium-rare. Rest for 10 minutes before carving between bones. Serve Rack of Lamb with Herb Crust hot and enjoy.', 20, 30, 2, 'hard', '/images/recipes/0e7610df-6bdc-4905-b869-cb54e2d0c8be.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:27:06', '2026-06-18 00:00:23', 1, 0),
(83, 'Shrimp Scampi', 'Shrimp Scampi is a Western-style dish prepared with large shrimp, butter, garlic, white wine, and linguine. It is a bright and garlicky recipe suitable for a quick weeknight dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Shrimp Scampi. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cook linguine until al dente and reserve half a cup of pasta water before draining. Melt butter with olive oil in a large pan over medium-high heat and sauté garlic until golden and fragrant. Add shrimp in a single layer and cook for 2 minutes per side until pink and opaque, then remove and set aside. Deglaze the pan with white wine and lemon juice and simmer for 2 minutes. Return shrimp to the pan, add pasta and a splash of pasta water, and toss to combine. Season with salt, pepper, and red pepper flakes, and finish with fresh parsley. Serve Shrimp Scampi hot and enjoy.', 10, 20, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/258d016b-bcd2-4cf2-8307-e76f03b6560f.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:30:47', '2026-06-18 00:00:32', 1, 0),
(84, 'Chicken Tikka Masala', 'Chicken Tikka Masala is a Western-style dish prepared with marinated chicken, tomato-cream sauce, and aromatic spices. It is a rich and mildly spiced recipe suitable for curry lovers.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Chicken Tikka Masala. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Marinate chicken pieces in yogurt, lemon juice, and spices for at least 1 hour. Grill or broil the marinated chicken until lightly charred, then set aside. In a large pan, sauté onion in oil until golden, then add ginger, garlic, and tomato paste and cook for 2 minutes. Stir in crushed tomatoes, spices, and broth and simmer for 15 minutes. Add the grilled chicken and heavy cream and simmer for another 10 minutes until the sauce is thick and fragrant. Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve with rice or naan. Serve Chicken Tikka Masala hot and enjoy.', 70, 35, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/9a04324c-12fd-4858-bab8-b9d776ae5b75.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:36:35', '2026-06-18 00:00:19', 1, 0),
(85, 'Beef Wellington', 'Beef Wellington is a Western-style dish prepared with beef tenderloin, mushroom duxelles, prosciutto, and puff pastry. It is a luxurious and impressive recipe suitable for special occasions.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Beef Wellington. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Sear the beef tenderloin in a hot pan with oil until browned all over, then brush with mustard and allow to cool completely. Finely chop mushrooms and cook with garlic and shallots until all moisture has evaporated to form a dry duxelles. Lay prosciutto slices on cling wrap, spread duxelles over them, place beef at the edge, and roll tightly. Refrigerate for 30 minutes. Wrap the beef roll in puff pastry, seal edges with egg wash, and brush the top with egg wash. Score lightly and bake in a preheated oven at 220°C for 25–30 minutes until the pastry is golden and the beef reaches desired doneness. Rest for 10 minutes before slicing. Serve Beef Wellington hot and enjoy.', 60, 35, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/44defbb3-9013-4589-8a93-b3c02c847b51.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:45:20', '2026-06-17 23:59:10', 1, 0),
(86, 'Pancakes with Maple Syrup', 'Pancakes with Maple Syrup is a Western-style dish prepared with flour, buttermilk, egg, and butter. It is a fluffy and sweet recipe suitable for breakfast or brunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pancakes with Maple Syrup. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Whisk together flour, baking powder, baking soda, sugar, and salt in a large bowl. In a separate bowl, whisk buttermilk, egg, melted butter, and vanilla extract together. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients and stir gently until just combined, leaving some lumps for fluffiness. Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat and lightly grease with butter. Pour a quarter cup of batter per pancake and cook until bubbles form on the surface, then flip and cook for 1 more minute until golden. Stack and serve with butter and maple syrup. Serve Pancakes with Maple Syrup warm and enjoy.', 10, 20, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/9ff0ff97-9c75-473e-ba20-a4e95c0a9080.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:50:28', '2026-06-18 00:00:07', 1, 0),
(87, 'Lobster Bisque', 'Lobster Bisque is a Western-style dish prepared with lobster, heavy cream, brandy, and aromatic vegetables. It is a velvety and luxurious recipe suitable for a special dinner starter.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Lobster Bisque. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cook lobster tails and remove the meat, reserving the shells. Sauté the shells with onion, celery, and carrot in butter until fragrant. Add tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, then deglaze with brandy and cook off the alcohol. Add broth, thyme, and bay leaf and simmer for 30 minutes. Strain the broth and discard solids. Return the broth to the pot, add heavy cream, and simmer until slightly reduced. Chop the lobster meat and stir into the bisque. Season with salt, white pepper, and a squeeze of lemon juice. Garnish with cream swirl and chives. Serve Lobster Bisque hot and enjoy.', 20, 50, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/ba5cd004-359d-4fdc-a526-6ce89c8f18bf.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 18:55:29', '2026-06-17 23:59:45', 1, 0),
(88, 'Greek Salad', 'Greek Salad is a Western-style dish prepared with tomato, cucumber, red onion, olives, and feta cheese. It is a fresh and tangy recipe suitable for a light lunch or side dish.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Greek Salad. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cut tomatoes into wedges and cucumber into thick half-moons. Slice red onion thinly and halve the Kalamata olives. Combine all vegetables in a large bowl. Drizzle generously with extra-virgin olive oil, add red wine vinegar, dried oregano, salt, and pepper, and toss gently to combine. Top with a block or crumbles of feta cheese and a few whole olives. Serve Greek Salad at room temperature and enjoy.', 10, 0, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/d63053a6-be1f-4b2c-98e6-1cc7732a4cdd.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 19:22:05', '2026-06-18 00:00:17', 1, 0),
(89, 'Pulled Pork Sandwich', 'Pulled Pork Sandwich is a Western-style dish prepared with slow-cooked pork shoulder, smoky BBQ sauce, and brioche bun. It is a tender and smoky recipe suitable for casual gatherings.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pulled Pork Sandwich. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rub pork shoulder with brown sugar, smoked paprika, garlic powder, cumin, salt, and pepper. Place in a slow cooker or covered roasting pan with apple cider vinegar and cook on low for 8 hours or at 150°C for 4 hours until fall-apart tender. Shred the pork using two forks and mix with BBQ sauce. Toast the brioche buns lightly. Pile the pulled pork onto the bottom bun and top with coleslaw. Close with the top bun and serve. Serve Pulled Pork Sandwich hot and enjoy.', 15, 480, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/51ab4a81-4487-492c-a3cc-eca66f455d13.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:32:39', '2026-06-18 00:00:16', 1, 0),
(90, 'Penne Arrabbiata', 'Penne Arrabbiata is a Western-style dish prepared with penne, crushed tomatoes, garlic, and red chilli flakes. It is a spicy and bold recipe suitable for quick pasta nights.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Penne Arrabbiata. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cook penne in a large pot of salted boiling water until al dente and reserve a cup of pasta water before draining. In a wide pan, heat olive oil and sauté garlic and red chilli flakes until the garlic is golden. Pour in crushed tomatoes, season with salt, and simmer for 15 minutes until the sauce has thickened. Add the drained penne to the sauce and toss well, adding a splash of pasta water to loosen if needed. Finish with a drizzle of olive oil and garnish with fresh basil and grated parmesan. Serve Penne Arrabbiata hot and enjoy.', 5, 25, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/4e949c45-bb5a-4884-9189-946e0cbb6a13.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:37:29', '2026-06-17 23:59:47', 1, 0),
(91, 'Roast Chicken with Root Vegetables', 'Roast Chicken with Root Vegetables is a Western-style dish prepared with whole chicken, potato, carrot, and fresh herbs. It is a classic and wholesome recipe suitable for a Sunday family dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Roast Chicken with Root Vegetables. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Pat the chicken dry and rub all over with softened butter mixed with garlic, thyme, rosemary, salt, and pepper. Stuff the cavity with lemon halves and herb sprigs. Toss potato, carrot, and parsnip chunks with olive oil, salt, and pepper and arrange in the roasting tray. Place the chicken on top and roast in a preheated oven at 200°C for 1 hour 20 minutes, basting halfway through, until the juices run clear. Rest for 15 minutes before carving. Serve Roast Chicken with Root Vegetables hot and enjoy.', 20, 90, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/2b87c65c-d538-4312-a9be-10f4434c9499.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:40:13', '2026-06-18 00:00:08', 1, 0),
(92, 'Tiramisu', 'Tiramisu is a Western-style dish prepared with mascarpone, espresso-soaked ladyfingers, and cocoa powder. It is a light and indulgent recipe suitable for dessert.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Tiramisu. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Brew strong espresso and allow to cool, then mix with a splash of Marsala wine or coffee liqueur. Whisk egg yolks with sugar over a double boiler until pale and thick, then fold in mascarpone until smooth. In a separate bowl, whisk heavy cream to soft peaks and gently fold into the mascarpone mixture. Quickly dip ladyfingers in the espresso and arrange a layer in a serving dish. Spread half the mascarpone cream over the top. Repeat with another layer of dipped ladyfingers and the remaining cream. Smooth the surface and dust generously with cocoa powder. Refrigerate for at least 4 hours or overnight. Serve Tiramisu chilled and enjoy.', 30, 0, 6, 'easy', '/images/recipes/ca43edd3-a7bf-4aa7-a3b3-40b59e3679ad.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:44:22', '2026-06-18 00:00:14', 1, 0),
(93, 'Corn Chowder', 'Corn Chowder is a Western-style dish prepared with sweet corn, potato, cream, and smoked paprika. It is a thick and sweet recipe suitable for a warming lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Corn Chowder. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Sauté onion, celery, and garlic in butter in a large pot until softened. Add diced potato and smoked paprika and stir for 1 minute. Pour in broth and bring to a boil, then simmer until potato is tender, about 15 minutes. Add corn kernels and heavy cream and simmer for another 5 minutes. Use an immersion blender to partially blend the soup for a creamy yet chunky texture. Season with salt and pepper, ladle into bowls, and garnish with crispy bacon bits and fresh chives. Serve Corn Chowder hot and enjoy.', 15, 30, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/780ac767-160d-4154-a76f-7d56f585b619.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:47:23', '2026-06-18 00:00:31', 1, 0),
(94, 'Beef Tacos', 'Beef Tacos is a Western-style dish prepared with seasoned ground beef, corn tortillas, salsa, and fresh toppings. It is a bold and festive recipe suitable for casual dinners.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Beef Tacos. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Brown ground beef in a pan over medium-high heat, breaking it up as it cooks. Drain excess fat, then add taco seasoning and a splash of water and stir to coat evenly. Simmer for 3 minutes until the beef is flavorful and saucy. Warm corn tortillas directly over a gas flame or in a dry pan. Spoon seasoned beef into each tortilla and top with shredded cheese, shredded lettuce, diced tomato, sour cream, and fresh salsa. Finish with a squeeze of lime juice. Serve Beef Tacos immediately and enjoy.', 10, 15, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/d23ca333-6731-44b9-994b-0f335c5ab395.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:50:44', '2026-06-17 23:59:43', 1, 0),
(95, 'Bangers and Mash', 'Bangers and Mash is a Western-style dish prepared with pork sausages, creamy mashed potato, and rich onion gravy. It is a hearty and nostalgic recipe suitable for a comforting dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Bangers and Mash. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cook the sausages in a pan with a little oil over medium heat, turning regularly, until browned and cooked through, about 15 minutes, then set aside. Boil potato chunks until tender, drain well, and mash with butter, warm milk, salt, and pepper until smooth and creamy. For the gravy, sauté thinly sliced onions in butter in the same pan until deeply caramelised, about 20 minutes. Add flour and stir for 1 minute, then pour in beef broth and Worcestershire sauce and simmer until thickened. Spoon mashed potato onto plates, add sausages, and pour onion gravy generously over the top. Serve Bangers and Mash hot and enjoy.', 10, 35, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/abb00ec9-3d82-4a5d-bece-5b3d0285cb10.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:54:16', '2026-06-17 23:59:41', 1, 0),
(96, 'Beef Stroganoff', 'Beef Stroganoff is a Western-style dish prepared with tender beef strips, mushrooms, onion, and sour cream sauce. It is a creamy and savory recipe suitable for a weeknight dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Beef Stroganoff. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Season beef strips with salt and pepper and sear quickly in a hot pan with oil in batches until browned but not fully cooked through, then set aside. In the same pan, sauté onion and garlic until soft, then add mushrooms and cook until golden. Sprinkle flour over the mushrooms and stir for 1 minute. Pour in beef broth and Worcestershire sauce and stir until smooth, then simmer for 5 minutes until slightly thickened. Reduce heat, stir in sour cream, and return the beef to the pan. Heat through gently without boiling. Serve over egg noodles or rice, garnished with fresh dill. Serve Beef Stroganoff hot and enjoy.', 15, 25, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/1fecf2a1-5d5a-4f05-b3f5-685a89d4ff0f.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 20:57:34', '2026-06-18 00:00:12', 1, 0),
(97, 'Lemon Tart', 'Lemon Tart is a Western-style dish prepared with buttery shortcrust pastry, zesty lemon curd, and a dusting of icing sugar. It is a bright and tangy recipe suitable for dessert.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Lemon Tart. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Make the pastry by rubbing cold butter into flour and icing sugar until it resembles breadcrumbs, then bind with egg yolk and cold water. Press into a tart tin and chill for 30 minutes. Blind bake at 180°C for 15 minutes, remove weights, and bake for another 5 minutes until golden. For the filling, whisk together lemon juice, lemon zest, eggs, sugar, and melted butter until combined, then pour into the baked shell. Bake at 160°C for 20–25 minutes until the filling is just set with a slight wobble. Cool completely, then dust with icing sugar before slicing. Serve Lemon Tart at room temperature and enjoy.', 50, 40, 8, 'hard', '/images/recipes/6d6ac516-a938-4723-85f2-e4989e955fdb.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:02:58', '2026-06-17 23:59:30', 1, 0),
(98, 'Nicoise Salad', 'Nicoise Salad is a Western-style dish prepared with tuna, green beans, boiled egg, olive, and potato. It is a fresh and protein-rich recipe suitable for a light yet filling lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Nicoise Salad. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Boil baby potatoes until tender, then halve and set aside to cool. Blanch green beans in salted boiling water for 3 minutes, then transfer to ice water to keep them crisp and green. Hard-boil the eggs, peel, and halve. Make the dressing by whisking Dijon mustard, red wine vinegar, olive oil, salt, and pepper together. Arrange lettuce leaves on a large plate and layer with tuna, potatoes, green beans, halved eggs, olives, cherry tomatoes, and anchovies. Drizzle the Dijon dressing over everything. Serve Nicoise Salad at room temperature and enjoy.', 20, 15, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/57652839-baed-4eb8-a100-bdc40e05177b.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:06:50', '2026-06-18 00:00:10', 1, 0),
(99, 'Fish and Chips', 'Fish and Chips is a Western-style dish prepared with battered white fish fillet and thick-cut fried potato chips. It is a crispy and classic recipe suitable for a casual dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Fish and Chips. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cut potatoes into thick chips, parboil for 5 minutes, and drain well. Fry the chips in oil at 160°C for 5 minutes until pale and just cooked, then remove and set aside. Make the batter by whisking together flour, baking powder, salt, and cold beer until smooth. Pat fish fillets dry, season with salt, dust lightly with flour, then dip in the batter. Increase oil temperature to 190°C and fry the battered fish for 6–8 minutes until golden and crispy. Raise the temperature and fry the chips a second time for 3 minutes until deep golden and crispy. Season chips with salt and serve with fish, malt vinegar, and tartar sauce. Serve Fish and Chips immediately and enjoy.', 20, 25, 2, 'medium', '/images/recipes/25587fdb-1b19-44d6-ad0b-b566a69d8506.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:10:08', '2026-06-17 23:59:39', 1, 0),
(100, 'Croque Monsieur', 'Croque Monsieur is a Western-style dish prepared with toasted bread, ham, Gruyère cheese, and béchamel sauce. It is a rich and golden recipe suitable for a satisfying lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Croque Monsieur. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Make a béchamel sauce by melting butter in a small pan, stirring in flour to form a paste, then gradually whisking in warm milk until the sauce is smooth and thick. Season with salt, pepper, and nutmeg. Spread béchamel on one side of each bread slice. Layer ham and grated Gruyère on one slice, top with the other slice béchamel-side in. Spread more béchamel over the top of the sandwich and cover with more Gruyère. Place on a baking tray and grill under a hot broiler for 5–7 minutes until the cheese is bubbly and golden. Serve Croque Monsieur hot and enjoy.', 10, 15, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/7059fa17-62ba-42f9-9e13-73edb56f83e6.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:12:53', '2026-06-17 23:59:36', 1, 0),
(101, 'Minestrone Soup', 'Minestrone Soup is a Western-style dish prepared with seasonal vegetables, cannellini beans, pasta, and tomato broth. It is a hearty and nutritious recipe suitable for any season.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Minestrone Soup. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat olive oil in a large pot and sauté onion, carrot, celery, and garlic until softened. Add diced zucchini, green beans, and potato and stir for 2 minutes. Pour in canned tomatoes and vegetable broth, add thyme and bay leaf, and bring to a boil. Simmer for 20 minutes, then add cannellini beans and small pasta and cook for another 10 minutes until the pasta is tender. Remove the bay leaf, season with salt and pepper, and stir in a handful of chopped fresh basil. Ladle into bowls and finish with a drizzle of olive oil and grated parmesan. Serve Minestrone Soup hot and enjoy.', 20, 40, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/2be5577f-0351-4fa4-b05e-03c48bf82524.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:17:04', '2026-06-17 23:59:28', 1, 0),
(102, 'Club Sandwich', 'Club Sandwich is a Western-style dish prepared with triple-decker toasted bread, chicken, bacon, lettuce, tomato, and mayo. It is a classic and filling recipe suitable for lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Club Sandwich. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Toast all three slices of bread until golden. Cook bacon until crispy and slice or shred the cooked chicken breast. Spread mayonnaise on one side of each bread slice. On the first slice lay lettuce, sliced tomato, and seasoned chicken. Place the second slice of bread mayo-side down to close, then mayo-side up for the next layer. Add more lettuce, tomato, bacon, and sliced egg. Top with the third slice mayo-side down and press gently. Secure with toothpicks and cut diagonally into quarters. Serve Club Sandwich immediately and enjoy.', 15, 10, 1, 'easy', '/images/recipes/6dd0004f-8e25-4d44-a6fb-1b9429649651.png', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:21:04', '2026-06-17 23:59:25', 1, 0),
(103, 'Chocolate Lava Cake', 'Chocolate Lava Cake is a Western-style dish prepared with dark chocolate, butter, egg, and sugar. It is a decadent and gooey recipe suitable for a show-stopping dessert.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Chocolate Lava Cake. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Grease ramekins generously with butter and dust with cocoa powder. Melt dark chocolate and butter together in a double boiler until smooth, then set aside to cool slightly. Whisk eggs, egg yolks, and sugar together vigorously until pale and slightly thickened. Fold the chocolate mixture into the egg mixture, then sift in flour and fold until just combined. Pour the batter evenly into the prepared ramekins and refrigerate for 30 minutes. Bake in a preheated oven at 220°C for exactly 12 minutes until the edges are set but the centre is still soft. Immediately invert onto serving plates and dust with icing sugar. Serve Chocolate Lava Cake hot and enjoy.', 45, 12, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/c00153b0-a03e-41a1-b051-8b9e93feed6e.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:28:22', '2026-06-17 23:59:32', 1, 0),
(104, 'Quiche Lorraine', 'Quiche Lorraine is a Western-style dish prepared with shortcrust pastry, bacon, egg custard, and Gruyère cheese. It is a golden and savory recipe suitable for brunch or lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Quiche Lorraine. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Line a tart tin with shortcrust pastry, prick the base, and blind bake at 180°C for 15 minutes, then remove the baking weights and bake for another 5 minutes until lightly golden. Cook bacon lardons in a pan until golden and scatter over the pastry base along with grated Gruyère. Whisk together eggs, heavy cream, salt, pepper, and a pinch of nutmeg until smooth and pour over the bacon and cheese. Bake at 170°C for 30–35 minutes until the custard is just set with a slight wobble. Cool for 10 minutes before slicing. Serve Quiche Lorraine warm or at room temperature and enjoy.', 35, 55, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/4cae8416-6743-4277-9dee-bef04e6832da.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 21:32:29', '2026-06-17 23:59:34', 1, 0),
(105, 'Shepherd\'s Pie', 'Shepherd\'s Pie is a Western-style dish prepared with ground lamb, mixed vegetables, and creamy mashed potato topping. It is a wholesome and comforting recipe suitable for a family dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Shepherd\'s Pie. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Brown ground lamb in a large oven-proof pan with oil, then drain excess fat. Add onion, garlic, carrot, and celery and cook until softened. Stir in tomato paste, Worcestershire sauce, flour, broth, and fresh thyme, and simmer for 20 minutes until the mixture is thick and saucy. Meanwhile, boil potatoes until tender and mash with butter, milk, salt, and pepper until smooth. Spread the lamb mixture evenly in the pan, top with mashed potato, and rough up the surface with a fork. Bake in a preheated oven at 200°C for 25 minutes until the potato topping is golden. Serve Shepherd\'s Pie hot and enjoy.', 20, 55, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/8181329b-91e5-406b-b2a6-9b86fa965b0f.png', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:11:45', '2026-06-17 23:59:23', 1, 0),
(106, 'Prawn Cocktail', 'Prawn Cocktail is a Western-style dish prepared with poached prawns, Marie Rose sauce, and crisp lettuce. It is a light and retro recipe suitable for a dinner party starter.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Prawn Cocktail. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Poach prawns in lightly salted simmering water for 2–3 minutes until just pink and cooked through, then transfer to ice water and peel. Make the Marie Rose sauce by mixing mayonnaise, ketchup, Worcestershire sauce, lemon juice, and a dash of hot sauce until smooth. Shred iceberg lettuce and divide between serving glasses. Arrange prawns on top of the lettuce, spoon Marie Rose sauce over, and garnish with a slice of lemon and a sprinkle of paprika. Serve Prawn Cocktail chilled and enjoy.', 15, 5, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/02ffbe41-2827-4468-85b3-e69b9912cdf5.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:16:51', '2026-06-17 23:59:22', 1, 0),
(107, 'Pork Schnitzel', 'Pork Schnitzel is a Western-style dish prepared with pounded pork cutlet, breadcrumbs, and egg coating. It is a crispy and golden recipe suitable for a satisfying weeknight dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pork Schnitzel. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Place pork cutlets between cling wrap and pound to an even 5 mm thickness. Season both sides with salt and pepper. Set up a breading station with seasoned flour, beaten egg, and breadcrumbs. Coat each cutlet first in flour, then egg, then press firmly into breadcrumbs to coat evenly. Heat a generous amount of oil in a large pan over medium-high heat and fry the schnitzels for 3–4 minutes per side until deep golden and cooked through. Drain on paper towels. Serve immediately with a wedge of lemon and a side of potato salad. Serve Pork Schnitzel hot and enjoy.', 20, 15, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/3b723afe-9056-4636-9c22-62530f322d52.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:23:09', '2026-06-17 23:59:20', 1, 0),
(108, 'Baked Mac and Cheese', 'Baked Mac and Cheese is a Western-style dish prepared with macaroni, cheddar béchamel, and a golden breadcrumb topping. It is a rich and comforting recipe suitable for family gatherings.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Baked Mac and Cheese. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cook macaroni until just under al dente and drain. Make a béchamel by melting butter in a large saucepan, whisking in flour to form a roux, then gradually adding warm milk while stirring until thick and smooth. Remove from heat and stir in grated cheddar and gruyère, mustard powder, salt, and pepper until melted. Fold in the cooked macaroni and pour into a greased baking dish. Mix breadcrumbs with melted butter and scatter over the top. Bake in a preheated oven at 190°C for 25 minutes until the top is golden and bubbling. Rest for 5 minutes before serving. Serve Baked Mac and Cheese hot and enjoy.', 15, 40, 6, 'easy', '/images/recipes/0c7c4161-7285-4570-884f-c6d18bb78a6f.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:29:28', '2026-06-17 23:59:18', 1, 0),
(109, 'Waldorf Salad', 'Waldorf Salad is a Western-style dish prepared with apple, celery, walnut, grape, and creamy mayonnaise dressing. It is a crunchy and refreshing recipe suitable for a light side dish or starter.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Waldorf Salad. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Core and dice the apples into bite-sized pieces and toss immediately with lemon juice to prevent browning. Slice celery thinly and halve the grapes. In a large bowl, combine apple, celery, grapes, toasted walnut halves, and raisins. Make the dressing by whisking together mayonnaise, Greek yogurt, lemon juice, salt, and a touch of honey until smooth. Pour dressing over the salad and fold gently to coat everything evenly. Serve on a bed of lettuce and garnish with extra walnuts. Serve Waldorf Salad chilled and enjoy.', 15, 0, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/9be8f459-39d5-4882-b5a2-fe60b7c21774.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:35:04', '2026-06-17 23:59:51', 1, 0),
(110, 'Steak with Peppercorn Sauce', 'Steak with Peppercorn Sauce is a Western-style dish prepared with ribeye or sirloin steak and a rich cracked peppercorn cream sauce. It is a bold and indulgent recipe suitable for a restaurant-quality dinner at home.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Steak with Peppercorn Sauce. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Bring the steak to room temperature and pat dry. Season generously with salt and press cracked black pepper onto both sides. Heat oil and butter in a cast iron pan over high heat and sear the steak for 3–4 minutes per side for medium-rare. Remove the steak and rest under foil for 5 minutes. In the same pan, sauté shallots until soft, deglaze with brandy and allow the alcohol to cook off. Add beef broth and simmer for 2 minutes, then pour in heavy cream and green peppercorns and simmer until the sauce coats a spoon. Season with salt, pour over the rested steak, and serve with fries or roasted vegetables. Serve Steak with Peppercorn Sauce hot and enjoy.', 10, 15, 2, 'medium', '/images/recipes/36de0bde-0770-4685-9e71-bcda590a4fcd.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:44:43', '2026-06-17 23:59:17', 1, 0),
(111, 'Coq au Vin', 'Coq au Vin is a Western-style dish prepared with chicken braised in red wine, mushrooms, bacon, and pearl onions. It is a deep and rustic recipe suitable for a French-inspired dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Coq au Vin. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Season chicken pieces with salt and pepper and sear in a large Dutch oven with oil until golden on all sides, then remove and set aside. Cook bacon lardons in the same pot until crispy, then add pearl onions and mushrooms and sauté until golden. Stir in garlic and tomato paste and cook for 1 minute. Deglaze with brandy and cook for 1 minute, then pour in red wine and broth. Return the chicken to the pot, add thyme and bay leaf, cover, and braise over low heat for 1 hour until the chicken is tender and the sauce is rich. Remove the bay leaf and thyme, adjust seasoning, and serve garnished with fresh parsley over mashed potato or crusty bread. Serve Coq au Vin hot and enjoy.', 20, 75, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/43764f56-4cee-41dc-a5fb-e37bdbb9d967.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:49:13', '2026-06-17 23:59:49', 1, 0),
(112, 'Apple Crumble', 'Apple Crumble is a Western-style dish prepared with spiced stewed apple and a buttery oat crumble topping. It is a warm and homely recipe suitable for a classic dessert.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Apple Crumble. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Peel, core, and slice the apples into a buttered baking dish. Toss with sugar, cinnamon, and a squeeze of lemon juice. For the crumble, rub cold butter into flour and sugar until the mixture resembles coarse breadcrumbs, then stir in rolled oats. Scatter the crumble topping evenly over the apples and press down lightly. Bake in a preheated oven at 190°C for 35–40 minutes until the topping is golden and the apple is bubbling at the edges. Rest for 5 minutes and serve warm with vanilla ice cream or custard. Serve Apple Crumble warm and enjoy.', 20, 40, 6, 'easy', '/images/recipes/807dfea2-7901-41c9-a753-6e77ab574a17.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:53:29', '2026-06-17 23:59:15', 1, 0),
(113, 'Gazpacho', 'Gazpacho is a Western-style dish prepared with blended ripe tomatoes, cucumber, red pepper, and olive oil. It is a chilled and refreshing recipe suitable for a hot summer starter.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Gazpacho. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Roughly chop the ripe tomatoes, cucumber, red pepper, and red onion and add to a blender. Add garlic, olive oil, red wine vinegar, salt, and a splash of cold water. Blend on high until very smooth, then pass through a fine sieve for a silky texture. Taste and adjust salt, vinegar, and olive oil. Refrigerate for at least 2 hours until very cold. Serve in chilled bowls with a drizzle of olive oil, diced cucumber, and crusty croutons on top. Serve Gazpacho cold and enjoy.', 20, 0, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/21f7d529-1cc6-4db8-86a9-44bcf446f9ad.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-17 23:57:33', '2026-06-17 23:59:13', 1, 0),
(114, 'Rendang Daging', 'Rendang Daging is a Malay-style dish prepared with beef, coconut milk, lemongrass, and kerisik. It is a rich and deeply spiced recipe suitable for festive occasions.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Rendang Daging. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, ginger, galangal, lemongrass, dried chillies, and turmeric into a smooth paste. Heat oil in a heavy pot and fry the paste until fragrant and the oil separates. Add beef cubes and stir to coat evenly with the paste. Pour in coconut milk, add kaffir lime leaves, turmeric leaves, and season with salt and sugar. Simmer on low heat, stirring occasionally, for 1.5 to 2 hours until the liquid reduces and the beef becomes tender. Add kerisik and continue cooking until the rendang is dry and dark. Serve Rendang Daging with steamed rice and enjoy.', 30, 120, 5, 'hard', '/images/recipes/1fe34463-cd3f-4d83-b2cd-1d9675df8167.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:08:07', '2026-06-18 19:17:42', 3, 0),
(115, 'Nasi Lemak', 'Nasi Lemak is a Malay-style dish prepared with fragrant coconut rice, sambal, anchovies, peanuts, and cucumber. It is an aromatic and satisfying recipe suitable for breakfast or any meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Nasi Lemak. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rinse rice and cook with coconut milk, pandan leaves, lemongrass, and salt until fluffy and fragrant. For the sambal, blend dried chillies, shallots, and garlic, then fry in oil until dark and fragrant, season with tamarind juice, salt, and sugar. Fry dried anchovies until golden and crispy, and dry-fry peanuts until toasted. Arrange the coconut rice on a plate and serve alongside sambal, crispy anchovies, toasted peanuts, halved hard-boiled egg, and fresh cucumber slices. Serve Nasi Lemak warm and enjoy.', 20, 35, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/9c5d6361-5fea-4099-b127-900edbf84595.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:14:40', '2026-06-18 19:18:08', 3, 0),
(116, 'Laksa Lemak', 'Laksa Lemak is a Malay-style dish prepared with thick rice noodles, prawns, and a rich coconut curry broth. It is a bold and creamy recipe suitable for a hearty meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Laksa Lemak. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, lemongrass, galangal, dried chillies, belacan, and turmeric into a laksa paste. Fry the paste in oil until fragrant and oil separates. Pour in chicken broth and bring to a boil, then add coconut milk and simmer for 10 minutes. Add prawns and fish cake slices and cook until the prawns are pink. Season with salt and sugar. Blanch thick rice noodles and divide into bowls. Ladle the broth and toppings over the noodles and garnish with bean sprouts, mint leaves, shredded chicken, and hard-boiled egg. Serve Laksa Lemak hot and enjoy.', 25, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/6aef2bfd-88f1-4318-a806-ae12538da42d.jpeg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:21:10', '2026-06-18 19:17:50', 3, 0),
(117, 'Ayam Percik', 'Ayam Percik is a Malay-style dish prepared with grilled chicken basted in spiced coconut marinade. It is a smoky and aromatic recipe suitable for gatherings and celebrations.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Ayam Percik. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend lemongrass, shallots, garlic, ginger, galangal, dried chillies, and turmeric into a smooth paste. Combine the paste with coconut milk, tamarind juice, salt, and sugar to make the marinade. Score the chicken pieces deeply and coat generously with the marinade. Allow to marinate for at least 2 hours or overnight. Grill over medium charcoal or in the oven at 200°C, basting repeatedly with the remaining marinade, for 35–40 minutes until the chicken is charred at the edges, cooked through, and the sauce is caramelised. Serve Ayam Percik hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 130, 40, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/b5aeba71-d427-4c6e-b7c5-b39068f62ca0.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:26:54', '2026-06-18 19:17:47', 3, 0),
(118, 'Mee Goreng Mamak', 'Mee Goreng Mamak is a Malay-style dish prepared with yellow noodles, tofu, prawns, egg, and a spicy tomato-based sauce. It is a bold and satisfying recipe suitable for a quick dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Mee Goreng Mamak. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend dried chillies and shallots into a coarse paste. Heat oil in a wok over high heat and fry the paste until fragrant. Add prawns and tofu and stir-fry until cooked. Push to the side of the wok, crack in the egg, and scramble until just set before mixing together. Add the yellow noodles and toss vigorously over high heat. Stir in tomato sauce, chilli sauce, soy sauce, and a splash of water. Add bean sprouts and stir-fry for another minute. Finish with a squeeze of lime juice and garnish with sliced red chilli and fried shallots. Serve Mee Goreng Mamak hot and enjoy.', 15, 15, 2, 'medium', '/images/recipes/555d9df0-7a56-4b15-a206-8af4051662af.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:35:00', '2026-06-18 19:18:23', 3, 0),
(119, 'Asam Pedas Ikan', 'Asam Pedas Ikan is a Malay-style dish prepared with fish, tamarind broth, okra, and chillies. It is a tangy and fiery recipe suitable for a bold everyday meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Asam Pedas Ikan. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, dried chillies, lemongrass, galangal, and belacan into a paste. Fry the paste in oil until fragrant and oil separates. Mix tamarind paste with water to make tamarind juice and pour into the pot. Add tomatoes, okra, long beans, kaffir lime leaves, and season with salt and sugar. Bring to a boil and simmer for 10 minutes. Gently lower in the fish pieces and simmer for another 8–10 minutes until the fish is cooked and the broth is deep red and tangy. Serve Asam Pedas Ikan hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 20, 25, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/05f8b14c-cb0e-4830-9ed5-fd18573f6458.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:39:20', '2026-06-18 19:18:17', 3, 0),
(120, 'Satay Ayam', 'Satay Ayam is a Malay-style dish prepared with spiced chicken skewers grilled over charcoal and served with peanut sauce. It is a smoky and aromatic recipe suitable for gatherings.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Satay Ayam. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend lemongrass, shallots, garlic, ginger, turmeric, coriander, and cumin into a marinade paste. Mix with chicken pieces, salt, sugar, and a drizzle of oil and marinate for at least 2 hours. Thread marinated chicken onto skewers. For the peanut sauce, blend roasted peanuts with dried chillies, shallots, garlic, lemongrass, tamarind juice, coconut milk, sugar, and salt, then cook until thick. Grill skewers over hot charcoal or a grill pan, turning and basting with oil and marinade, until charred and cooked through. Serve with peanut sauce, compressed rice cubes, and sliced cucumber and onion. Serve Satay Ayam hot and enjoy.', 130, 20, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/13d21359-354b-4e58-8c2f-c4f6b578c9b4.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:48:54', '2026-06-18 19:17:44', 3, 0),
(121, 'Sup Tulang Merah', 'Sup Tulang Merah is a Malay-style dish prepared with beef bones, tomato-based spiced broth, and aromatics. It is a rich and deeply flavoured recipe suitable for a hearty dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Sup Tulang Merah. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blanch beef bones in boiling water and drain to remove impurities. In a large pot, heat oil and fry blended shallots, garlic, ginger, and whole spices until fragrant. Add tomato paste and chilli paste and stir for 2 minutes. Add the blanched bones and cover with water. Bring to a boil, then simmer for at least 2 hours until the broth is rich and the meat is tender. Season with salt and sugar. Add tomatoes and simmer for 5 more minutes. Ladle into deep bowls and garnish with fried shallots, coriander, and a squeeze of lime. Serve Sup Tulang Merah hot with bread or rice and enjoy.', 20, 135, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/aa455c88-cd3b-4760-9637-09753b278db0.jpeg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:53:46', '2026-06-18 19:18:02', 3, 0),
(122, 'Nasi Goreng Kampung', 'Nasi Goreng Kampung is a Malay-style dish prepared with day-old rice, anchovies, egg, and chilli paste. It is a rustic and aromatic recipe suitable for a quick and satisfying meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Nasi Goreng Kampung. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat oil in a wok over high heat and fry dried anchovies until golden and crispy, then remove and set aside. In the same wok, fry belacan and chilli paste until fragrant. Add garlic and shallots and stir-fry until golden. Add the cold cooked rice and toss vigorously over high heat, breaking up any clumps. Season with soy sauce, kicap manis, and salt. Push rice to the side and crack in the egg, scrambling until just set before folding into the rice. Fold in water spinach and toss briefly. Plate the rice and top with crispy anchovies, fried egg, and sliced red chilli. Serve Nasi Goreng Kampung hot and enjoy.', 10, 15, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/aa1a4db1-5c66-4c20-916c-f0e2649b57c5.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 11:57:39', '2026-06-18 19:18:01', 3, 0),
(123, 'Sambal Udang', 'Sambal Udang is a Malay-style dish prepared with prawns cooked in a fiery sambal paste with tamarind. It is a spicy and tangy recipe suitable for pairing with steamed rice.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Sambal Udang. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend dried chillies, shallots, garlic, belacan, and lemongrass into a smooth sambal paste. Heat oil in a wok and fry the paste over medium heat until it is dark red, fragrant, and the oil separates, about 15 minutes. Mix tamarind paste with water and pour into the wok. Add sugar and salt and stir to combine. Add the prawns and toss to coat in the sambal. Cook until the prawns are curled and cooked through and the sauce clings thickly to them, about 5 minutes. Serve Sambal Udang hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 15, 25, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/cc949f06-cf78-41b9-8ff3-62d2b85bc59c.jpeg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 12:02:31', '2026-06-18 19:18:12', 3, 0),
(124, 'Lontong', 'Lontong is a Malay-style dish prepared with compressed rice cakes served in a rich vegetable coconut curry broth. It is a fragrant and hearty recipe suitable for breakfast or celebrations.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Lontong. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, lemongrass, galangal, dried chillies, and turmeric into a curry paste. Heat oil and fry the paste until fragrant. Add the long beans, cabbage, and tofu puffs and stir to coat. Pour in coconut milk and water and bring to a simmer. Add kaffir lime leaves and season with salt and sugar. Simmer for 20 minutes until the vegetables are tender and the broth is rich and creamy. Slice the compressed rice cakes and divide into bowls. Ladle the vegetable curry over the rice and top with fried shallots and hard-boiled egg. Serve Lontong hot and enjoy.', 20, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/d102bf5b-d25e-46d2-a8b4-0e2e10eeec12.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 12:13:43', '2026-06-18 19:17:39', 3, 0),
(125, 'Ikan Bakar', 'Ikan Bakar is a Malay-style dish prepared with whole fish marinated in spiced chilli paste and grilled over charcoal. It is a smoky and aromatic recipe suitable for casual dining.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Ikan Bakar. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend dried chillies, shallots, garlic, lemongrass, galangal, turmeric, and belacan into a spice paste. Mix the paste with tamarind juice, salt, and sugar to form the marinade. Score the fish on both sides and rub the marinade generously all over and inside the cavity. Allow to marinate for 30 minutes. Wrap the marinated fish in banana leaf and grill over medium charcoal heat for 10–12 minutes per side until the fish is fully cooked and fragrant. Serve Ikan Bakar hot with sambal kicap and steamed rice and enjoy.', 45, 25, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/8400bc98-9767-4945-b5cd-9ab5d44179ea.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 12:18:39', '2026-06-18 19:17:58', 3, 0),
(126, 'Bubur Ayam', 'Bubur Ayam is a Malay-style dish prepared with rice congee topped with shredded chicken, ginger, and crispy garnishes. It is a light and comforting recipe suitable for breakfast or when feeling unwell.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Bubur Ayam. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rinse rice and cook with chicken broth, ginger slices, and a pinch of salt over low heat, stirring occasionally, for 45 minutes until the rice breaks down into a smooth porridge. Add more broth if needed for consistency. Season with salt and white pepper. Poach or steam the chicken breast separately and shred into thin strips. Season the shredded chicken with a little soy sauce and sesame oil. Ladle the hot congee into bowls and top with shredded chicken, sliced ginger, fried shallots, chopped spring onion, sliced red chilli, and a drizzle of sesame oil. Serve Bubur Ayam hot and enjoy.', 10, 50, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/d0e2435b-936d-4163-aaf7-a11b2dc021e7.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 12:22:01', '2026-06-18 19:18:20', 3, 0);
INSERT INTO `recipes` (`recipe_id`, `title`, `description`, `instructions`, `prep_time`, `cook_time`, `servings`, `difficulty`, `image_url`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `is_duplicate_suspected`) VALUES
(127, 'Curry Kapitan', 'Curry Kapitan is a Malay-style dish prepared with chicken, thick coconut milk, lemongrass, and a rich spice paste. It is a creamy and aromatic recipe suitable for festive meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Curry Kapitan. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend dried chillies, fresh chillies, shallots, garlic, lemongrass, galangal, turmeric, candlenuts, and belacan into a fine paste. Heat oil in a pot and fry the paste until deeply fragrant and the oil separates. Add kaffir lime leaves and bruised lemongrass and stir for 1 minute. Add chicken pieces and toss to coat in the paste. Pour in coconut milk and season with salt and sugar. Simmer on medium-low heat for 30 minutes until the chicken is cooked through and the gravy is thick and rich. Squeeze in lime juice just before serving. Serve Curry Kapitan hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 20, 40, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/0b068de6-a4f0-4a52-b05f-1d134133ec87.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 12:26:11', '2026-06-18 19:17:14', 3, 0),
(128, 'Rojak', 'Rojak is a Malay-style dish prepared with mixed fruits, vegetables, tofu puffs, and a dark prawn paste dressing. It is a sweet, spicy, and tangy recipe suitable as a snack or appetiser.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Rojak. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cut pineapple, cucumber, jicama, unripe mango, and dried cuttlefish into bite-sized pieces. Deep-fry or pan-fry tofu puffs until golden, then cut into quarters. Make the dressing by mixing hae ko (thick black prawn paste) with chilli paste, sugar, tamarind juice, and lime juice until smooth and glossy. Toss all the fruit and vegetable pieces with the dressing until well coated. Transfer to a serving plate and sprinkle generously with crushed roasted peanuts and sesame seeds. Serve Rojak at room temperature and enjoy.', 20, 5, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/61b2b179-b430-4c18-94c3-fde2be9a765a.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 12:29:51', '2026-06-18 19:17:08', 3, 0),
(129, 'Masak Lemak Cili Padi Ayam', 'Masak Lemak Cili Padi Ayam is a Malay-style dish prepared with chicken simmered in a turmeric coconut milk broth with bird\'s eye chillies. It is a creamy and fiery recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Masak Lemak Cili Padi Ayam. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, bird\'s eye chillies, garlic, turmeric, and lemongrass into a paste. Combine with coconut milk and pour into a pot. Add chicken pieces, kaffir lime leaves, and lemongrass. Bring to a gentle simmer over medium heat, stirring occasionally to prevent the coconut milk from splitting. Add long beans and simmer until the chicken is cooked through and the gravy is thick and golden. Season with salt and adjust chilli heat to taste. Serve Masak Lemak Cili Padi Ayam hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 15, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/230b2822-2709-47ec-9450-917a4b243630.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 17:34:41', '2026-06-18 19:17:57', 3, 0),
(130, 'Kerabu Mangga', 'Kerabu Mangga is a Malay-style dish prepared with shredded unripe mango, dried shrimp, and toasted coconut dressed in a spicy lime dressing. It is a refreshing and punchy recipe suitable as a side salad.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Kerabu Mangga. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Peel and shred the unripe mango into thin julienne strips. Slice shallots and red chilli thinly. Dry-fry grated coconut until lightly toasted and golden. Pound dried shrimp coarsely. Mix lime juice, sugar, salt, and chilli paste to form the dressing. Combine shredded mango, shallots, red chilli, pounded dried shrimp, and toasted coconut in a bowl. Pour dressing over and toss well. Taste and adjust sourness, sweetness, and heat. Garnish with fresh coriander and serve. Serve Kerabu Mangga chilled and enjoy.', 20, 5, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/6f0bd23b-7a69-4cef-ab77-875d06acd49a.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 17:38:23', '2026-06-18 19:17:52', 3, 0),
(131, 'Nasi Dagang with Tuna Steak', 'Nasi Dagang is a Malay-style dish prepared with glutinous rice cooked in coconut milk and served with tuna fish curry. It is a fragrant and hearty recipe suitable for breakfast in Terengganu tradition.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Nasi Dagang. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak glutinous rice and regular rice together overnight, then drain. Steam the mixed rice for 20 minutes, then pour over coconut milk mixed with salt and fenugreek seeds. Toss to coat, then steam for another 20 minutes until fully cooked and fragrant. For the tuna curry, fry blended shallots, garlic, dried chillies, galangal, and lemongrass in oil until fragrant. Add tuna pieces, coconut milk, and season with salt and sugar. Simmer until the curry is thick and the fish is cooked. Serve the coconut rice with tuna curry, hard-boiled egg, and pickled vegetables. Serve Nasi Dagang hot and enjoy.', 480, 60, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/ed8e7e52-bb70-4b5f-b70c-c52a58f2277f.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 17:47:02', '2026-06-18 19:18:10', 3, 0),
(132, 'Pindang Ikan', 'Pindang Ikan is a Malay-style dish prepared with fish simmered in a light sour and spiced broth with turmeric. It is a fragrant and tangy recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pindang Ikan. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Bring water to a boil and add bruised lemongrass, sliced galangal, sliced turmeric, shallots, garlic, and bird\'s eye chillies. Simmer for 10 minutes to build the broth. Add tamarind juice and season with salt and sugar. Gently lower in the fish pieces and simmer for 10–12 minutes until fully cooked. Add tomato slices in the final 2 minutes. Taste and adjust the balance of sourness and salt. Garnish with fresh coriander leaves. Serve Pindang Ikan hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 15, 25, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/4b488503-be97-4e53-8c5e-186052a56a84.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 17:51:10', '2026-06-18 19:17:11', 3, 0),
(133, 'Perut Ikan', 'Perut Ikan is a Malay-style dish prepared with fermented fish stomach, vegetables, and coconut milk in a tangy broth. It is a unique and complex recipe suitable for adventurous food lovers.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Perut Ikan. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, lemongrass, galangal, turmeric, dried chillies, and belacan into a paste and fry until deeply fragrant. Add water and tamarind juice and bring to a boil. Add the fermented fish stomach and simmer for 15 minutes to develop the flavour. Pour in coconut milk and stir gently. Add eggplant, wild ginger flower, torch ginger bud, and long beans. Simmer until the vegetables are tender and the broth is thick and fragrant. Season with salt and sugar. Serve Perut Ikan hot with rice and enjoy.', 20, 35, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/f139e5c2-c8e5-4220-85be-00bacd8ddaaa.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 17:55:46', '2026-06-18 19:17:37', 3, 0),
(134, 'Ayam Masak Merah', 'Ayam Masak Merah is a Malay-style dish prepared with fried chicken cooked in a spiced tomato and chilli gravy. It is a vibrant and aromatic recipe suitable for celebrations and festive tables.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Ayam Masak Merah. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Season chicken pieces with turmeric and salt and shallow-fry until golden, then set aside. Blend shallots, garlic, ginger, dried chillies, and fresh red chillies into a paste and fry in oil until the paste is cooked and fragrant. Add tomato sauce, tomato puree, and a little water and stir to combine. Return the fried chicken to the pot and coat in the sauce. Simmer on low heat for 20 minutes until the chicken absorbs the gravy and the sauce thickens and turns deep red. Season with salt and sugar. Serve Ayam Masak Merah hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 20, 40, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/583338fa-82ed-4d88-b57a-9fe4ea1c5506.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 17:59:49', '2026-06-18 19:17:27', 3, 0),
(135, 'Kuih Seri Muka', 'Kuih Seri Muka is a Malay-style dish prepared with a glutinous rice base topped with a pandan custard layer. It is a fragrant and delicate recipe suitable for tea time.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Kuih Seri Muka. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak glutinous rice for at least 4 hours, drain, and mix with coconut milk, salt, and a little sugar. Press into a greased tray and steam for 25 minutes until cooked. For the pandan custard layer, blend pandan leaves with water and strain to get pandan juice. Whisk together pandan juice, coconut milk, eggs, sugar, and rice flour until smooth. Pour the custard mixture over the cooked glutinous rice base and steam for another 20–25 minutes until the custard layer is fully set. Cool completely before cutting into diamonds or rectangles. Serve Kuih Seri Muka at room temperature and enjoy.', 250, 50, 12, 'hard', '/images/recipes/25e947fe-1e79-4d73-ab60-501590d86b86.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:03:49', '2026-06-18 19:17:16', 3, 0),
(136, 'Karipap', 'Karipap is a Malay-style dish prepared with flaky pastry filled with spiced curried potato and chicken. It is a crispy and savory recipe suitable as a snack or appetiser.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Karipap. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Make the pastry by rubbing butter into flour and salt until crumbly, then add cold water gradually to form a smooth dough. Rest for 20 minutes. For the filling, sauté onion, garlic, and curry powder in oil. Add diced potato and chicken mince and cook until the potato is soft and the mixture is dry and fragrant. Season with salt and sugar and let cool. Roll the dough thin, cut into circles, place a spoonful of filling in the centre, fold, and crimp the edges. Deep-fry in oil at 170°C until golden and crispy all over. Drain on paper towels. Serve Karipap hot and enjoy.', 45, 25, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/e647757a-cd9f-4bff-aa5e-c554cab77bc4.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:07:53', '2026-06-18 19:17:25', 3, 0),
(137, 'Daging Masak Hitam', 'Daging Masak Hitam is a Malay-style dish prepared with beef simmered in a dark sweet soy sauce with whole spices. It is a rich and deeply flavoured recipe suitable for a special family meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Daging Masak Hitam. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, ginger, and dried chillies into a paste and fry in oil until fragrant. Add whole spices including star anise, cinnamon, cardamom, and cloves and fry for 1 minute. Add beef chunks and stir to seal. Pour in kicap manis, dark soy sauce, and water and stir to coat. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat, cover, and braise for 1.5 hours until the beef is tender and the sauce is thick and dark. Season with salt and a touch of sugar. Serve Daging Masak Hitam hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 20, 100, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/8d43373c-b68a-47f8-8eb9-fc3a046dbf4c.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:11:16', '2026-06-18 19:17:22', 3, 0),
(138, 'Mee Rebus', 'Mee Rebus is a Malay-style dish prepared with yellow noodles served in a thick sweet potato and beef broth. It is a hearty and indulgent recipe suitable for lunch or dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Mee Rebus. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Boil beef until tender, reserve the broth, and slice the beef thinly. Blend dried chillies, shallots, garlic, lemongrass, and dried shrimp into a paste and fry in oil until fragrant. Pour in the beef broth and bring to a boil. Add mashed sweet potato and stir until the broth thickens to a gravy-like consistency. Season with salt and sugar. Blanch yellow noodles and divide into bowls. Ladle the thick broth generously over the noodles. Top with sliced beef, fried tofu, hard-boiled egg, fried shallots, green chilli, and a squeeze of lime. Serve Mee Rebus hot and enjoy.', 25, 45, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/cd19a493-7687-49c3-8a28-304f3403e551.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:15:51', '2026-06-18 19:17:05', 3, 0),
(139, 'Sambal Belacan', 'Sambal Belacan is a Malay-style condiment prepared with fresh red chillies, bird\'s eye chillies, and toasted shrimp paste. It is a fiery and punchy recipe suitable as an accompaniment to any Malay meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Sambal Belacan. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Wrap the belacan in foil and toast directly over a flame or in a dry pan for 2–3 minutes until fragrant. Allow to cool. Pound the fresh red chillies and bird\'s eye chillies in a mortar until coarsely ground. Add the toasted belacan and pound together until combined but still slightly chunky. Squeeze in fresh lime juice and add sugar, then mix well. Taste and adjust the balance of heat, salt, and sourness with more lime or a pinch of salt as needed. Transfer to a small bowl. Serve Sambal Belacan fresh as a side condiment and enjoy.', 15, 5, 6, 'easy', '/images/recipes/8bd59185-08a4-477f-a9b3-7f43a1a5adb7.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:18:56', '2026-06-18 19:18:15', 3, 0),
(140, 'Soto Ayam', 'Soto Ayam is a Malay-style dish prepared with shredded chicken in a fragrant turmeric broth with rice or noodles. It is a light and warming recipe suitable for breakfast or lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Soto Ayam. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Simmer whole chicken in water with bruised lemongrass, ginger, kaffir lime leaves, and salt for 40 minutes until the chicken is cooked through. Remove the chicken, shred the meat, and reserve the broth. Blend shallots, garlic, galangal, turmeric, and candlenuts into a paste and fry in oil until fragrant. Pour the fried paste into the chicken broth and simmer for 10 minutes. Season with salt and white pepper. Blanch vermicelli noodles and divide into bowls. Ladle broth over the noodles and top with shredded chicken, fried shallots, boiled egg, sliced spring onion, and sambal on the side. Serve Soto Ayam hot and enjoy.', 20, 55, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/4ab148bc-4185-4cde-9c29-3db2507b401c.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:25:20', '2026-06-18 19:17:18', 3, 0),
(141, 'Lemang', 'Lemang is a Malay-style dish prepared with glutinous rice and coconut milk cooked inside bamboo tubes over an open fire. It is a fragrant and festive recipe suitable for Eid celebrations.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Lemang. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak glutinous rice for 4 hours and drain. Mix rice with coconut milk, salt, and pandan juice. Line bamboo tubes with banana leaf and fill with the rice and coconut milk mixture, leaving space as the rice will expand. Cook the bamboo tubes upright over glowing charcoal embers, rotating every 15 minutes, for about 1 to 1.5 hours until the rice is fully cooked and lightly charred on the outside. Allow to rest before splitting the bamboo and slicing the lemang into rounds. Serve Lemang with Rendang and enjoy.', 260, 90, 8, 'hard', '/images/recipes/3be532e9-4f1d-4c15-b37e-f7f3d60855a0.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:29:07', '2026-06-18 19:18:19', 3, 0),
(142, 'Ketupat', 'Ketupat is a Malay-style dish prepared with rice cooked inside woven coconut palm leaves. It is a traditional and fragrant recipe suitable as an accompaniment for festive dishes.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Ketupat. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Weave coconut leaf strips into small square pouches. Fill each pouch halfway with raw rice, leaving room for expansion, and secure the opening by folding the leaf strips. Bring a large pot of water to a rolling boil and submerge all the rice pouches. Boil for 3 to 4 hours, adding more hot water as needed to keep the pouches fully submerged, until the rice is fully cooked and compressed into a firm block. Remove from water and hang or place upright to drain and cool for at least 30 minutes. Slice and serve alongside satay, rendang, or peanut sauce. Serve Ketupat at room temperature and enjoy.', 30, 240, 8, 'hard', '/images/recipes/e077d823-813d-48c6-a53a-e69113dc6dae.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:32:48', '2026-06-18 19:17:29', 3, 0),
(143, 'Pajeri Nanas', 'Pajeri Nanas is a Malay-style dish prepared with pineapple cooked in a spiced coconut milk curry. It is a sweet and tangy recipe suitable as a side dish at festive meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pajeri Nanas. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, dried chillies, turmeric, galangal, and candlenuts into a paste. Fry the paste in oil with whole spices including star anise, cinnamon, and cardamom until fragrant. Add pineapple chunks and stir to coat. Pour in coconut milk and season with salt and sugar. Simmer on medium-low heat for 20 minutes until the pineapple softens and the curry thickens and turns glossy. Taste and balance the sweetness, tanginess, and spice. Serve Pajeri Nanas warm with rice and enjoy.', 15, 30, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/a1bd7ed2-32b8-4661-bf2c-0b2466c16c60.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:36:43', '2026-06-18 19:16:59', 3, 0),
(144, 'Gulai Tempeh', 'Gulai Tempeh is a Malay-style dish prepared with tempeh simmered in a spiced coconut milk curry. It is a nutty and aromatic recipe suitable for a vegetarian meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Gulai Tempeh. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Cut tempeh into thick slices and pan-fry in oil until golden on both sides, then set aside. Blend shallots, garlic, dried chillies, lemongrass, galangal, and turmeric into a paste. Fry the paste in oil until fragrant. Add kaffir lime leaves and lemongrass and stir for 1 minute. Pour in coconut milk and season with salt and sugar. Simmer for 10 minutes, then add the fried tempeh and long beans. Simmer for another 10 minutes until the sauce is thick and the tempeh has absorbed the curry. Serve Gulai Tempeh hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 15, 30, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/53d144d8-67c0-49b0-8390-8b4d461fd0e5.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:39:31', '2026-06-18 19:16:56', 3, 0),
(145, 'Nasi Tomato', 'Nasi Tomato is a Malay-style dish prepared with basmati rice cooked in tomato puree, ghee, and whole spices. It is a fragrant and colourful recipe suitable as a festive rice accompaniment.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Nasi Tomato. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rinse and soak basmati rice for 30 minutes, then drain. Heat ghee and oil in a heavy pot and fry whole spices including star anise, cinnamon, cardamom, and cloves until fragrant. Add sliced onion and fry until golden. Stir in tomato puree, tomato sauce, and chicken broth and bring to a boil. Add the soaked rice and stir once. Cover tightly and cook on low heat for 18 minutes until the rice is fluffy and the liquid is absorbed. Fluff with a fork and garnish with fried onions, raisins, cashews, and fresh coriander. Serve Nasi Tomato hot and enjoy.', 40, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/db8345d5-6ac5-4488-9ab1-7c32e09869ff.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:43:18', '2026-06-18 19:17:55', 3, 0),
(146, 'Ikan Masak Kicap', 'Ikan Masak Kicap is a Malay-style dish prepared with fish fried and then simmered in a sweet soy and chilli sauce. It is a glossy and savory recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Ikan Masak Kicap. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rub fish with turmeric and salt and shallow-fry until golden on both sides, then set aside. In the same pan, fry sliced shallots, garlic, ginger, and red chilli until softened. Pour in kicap manis, soy sauce, and a splash of water and stir. Return the fish to the pan and simmer for 5 minutes until the sauce thickens and coats the fish. Add sliced tomato and stir gently for the final 2 minutes. Garnish with spring onion. Serve Ikan Masak Kicap hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 10, 20, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/1706a115-3f5a-4c4f-bb1a-df21d6747480.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:47:22', '2026-06-18 19:16:52', 3, 0),
(147, 'Pulut Kuning', 'Pulut Kuning is a Malay-style dish prepared with turmeric-tinted glutinous rice cooked in coconut milk. It is a fragrant and festive recipe suitable for traditional ceremonies.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pulut Kuning. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak glutinous rice for at least 4 hours and drain. Mix turmeric powder into coconut milk. Combine the soaked rice with the turmeric coconut milk, salt, and pandan leaves in a steamer. Steam for 30 minutes, tossing halfway to ensure even cooking, until the rice is fully cooked, sticky, and golden yellow. Allow to cool slightly. Press the cooked rice into a mould or tray and flatten. Cut into diamond shapes when cooled and firm. Serve with sambal serunding (meat floss) or on its own. Serve Pulut Kuning at room temperature and enjoy.', 250, 35, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/b9c1c877-f95b-4297-8c4e-61ca42afbb1f.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:50:22', '2026-06-18 19:17:33', 3, 0),
(148, 'Sup Ekor', 'Sup Ekor is a Malay-style dish prepared with oxtail simmered for hours in a clear spiced broth. It is a rich and collagen-rich recipe suitable for a warming dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Sup Ekor. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blanch oxtail pieces in boiling water and drain. In a large pot, heat oil and fry blended shallots, garlic, and ginger until golden. Add whole spices including cinnamon, star anise, cardamom, and cloves and fry for 1 minute. Add the blanched oxtail and cover with water. Bring to a boil, skim off impurities, then reduce heat and simmer for 3 hours until the oxtail is tender and the broth is rich. Season with salt and white pepper. Add sliced potato and carrot in the final 20 minutes. Ladle into deep bowls and garnish with fried shallots and celery leaves. Serve Sup Ekor hot with bread and enjoy.', 20, 200, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/036e97e6-e2da-450e-9115-7db5a57f4d9d.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:54:08', '2026-06-18 19:17:03', 3, 0),
(149, 'Cucur Udang', 'Cucur Udang is a Malay-style dish prepared with prawn fritters made from a spiced batter. It is a crispy and savoury recipe suitable as a snack or teatime treat.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Cucur Udang. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Mix flour, rice flour, salt, turmeric powder, and baking powder in a bowl. Gradually add water and stir until a thick batter forms. Fold in whole small prawns, sliced shallots, sliced red chilli, and chopped spring onion. Heat oil in a deep pan to 170°C. Drop spoonfuls of batter into the oil and fry for 3–4 minutes per side until golden and crispy. Drain on paper towels. Serve hot with chilli sauce or peanut sauce on the side. Serve Cucur Udang hot and enjoy.', 15, 20, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/f044ea51-e71c-4856-9531-521e258d4362.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 18:56:55', '2026-06-18 19:16:54', 3, 0),
(150, 'Kari Kambing', 'Kari Kambing is a Malay-style dish prepared with mutton simmered in a fragrant coconut curry with whole spices. It is a robust and aromatic recipe suitable for festive gatherings.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Kari Kambing. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, ginger, dried chillies, lemongrass, and candlenuts into a paste. Heat oil and fry the paste with whole spices including star anise, cinnamon, and cardamom until fragrant. Add mutton pieces and stir to coat thoroughly. Pour in coconut milk and water and bring to a boil. Add curry leaves, kaffir lime leaves, and season with salt and sugar. Reduce heat and simmer for 1.5 hours until the mutton is tender and the curry is thick and aromatic. Adjust seasoning and garnish with fried shallots. Serve Kari Kambing hot with roti canai or steamed rice and enjoy.', 20, 100, 5, 'hard', '/images/recipes/3f864c44-6a33-487f-825e-698e798bbca4.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 19:02:21', '2026-06-18 19:17:02', 3, 0),
(151, 'Sayur Lodeh', 'Sayur Lodeh is a Malay-style dish prepared with mixed vegetables simmered in a light coconut milk broth. It is a mild and comforting recipe suitable for an everyday vegetable dish.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Sayur Lodeh. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend shallots, garlic, dried chillies, lemongrass, galangal, and turmeric into a paste. Fry the paste in oil until fragrant. Pour in coconut milk and water and bring to a gentle boil. Add cabbage, long beans, carrot, eggplant, and tofu puffs. Simmer for 15 minutes until all the vegetables are tender but still hold their shape. Season with salt and sugar. Add tempeh slices in the last 5 minutes. Serve Sayur Lodeh hot with compressed rice or steamed rice and enjoy.', 15, 25, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/44f8d81e-5fe3-4e72-8f56-d75cd62a02a0.jpeg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 19:05:27', '2026-06-18 19:16:50', 3, 0),
(152, 'Pengat Pisang', 'Pengat Pisang is a Malay-style dessert prepared with banana simmered in sweet coconut milk and palm sugar. It is a warm and fragrant recipe suitable as a traditional dessert.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pengat Pisang. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Bring coconut milk, water, and pandan leaves to a gentle simmer in a pot. Add grated palm sugar (gula Melaka) and stir until dissolved. Add peeled bananas cut into thick rounds and simmer gently for 10–12 minutes until the bananas are soft and the broth is fragrant and slightly thickened. Add a pinch of salt to balance the sweetness. Remove pandan leaves before serving. Ladle into bowls and serve warm or at room temperature. Serve Pengat Pisang warm and enjoy.', 10, 20, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/46a303e8-b850-43b9-8361-fbcb3911fa66.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-18 19:08:04', '2026-06-18 19:17:00', 3, 0),
(153, 'Cincalok Omelette', 'Cincalok Omelette is a Malay-style dish prepared with eggs and fermented shrimp (cincalok) pan-fried into a savoury omelette. It is a pungent and uniquely Malay recipe suitable for a quick meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Cincalok Omelette. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Crack eggs into a bowl and whisk until well beaten. Add cincalok, sliced shallots, sliced red chilli, and a pinch of white pepper and mix together. Heat oil in a non-stick pan over medium-high heat. Pour the egg mixture in and tilt the pan to spread evenly. Cook undisturbed until the edges are set and golden, then flip carefully and cook the other side for 1 minute. Slide onto a plate. Serve with steamed rice and sliced cucumber on the side. Serve Cincalok Omelette hot and enjoy.', 5, 8, 1, 'easy', '/images/recipes/ba152059-7e25-4df4-bb07-6773483a6b7f.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 19:11:37', '2026-06-18 19:17:31', 3, 0),
(154, 'Bubur Kacang Hijau', 'Bubur Kacang Hijau is a Malay-style dessert prepared with mung beans simmered with palm sugar and coconut milk. It is a sweet and creamy recipe suitable as a dessert or snack.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Bubur Kacang Hijau. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rinse and soak mung beans for 2 hours, then drain. Bring water to a boil and add the soaked mung beans. Simmer for 30–35 minutes until the beans are completely soft and beginning to break down. Add grated palm sugar and granulated sugar and stir until dissolved. Add pandan leaves and continue cooking for 5 minutes. Pour in coconut milk and simmer gently for another 5 minutes without boiling. Add a pinch of salt. Remove pandan leaves and ladle into bowls. Serve Bubur Kacang Hijau warm or at room temperature and enjoy.', 130, 45, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/cb0a8459-4035-4bcb-809b-7dd62c8956cd.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-18 19:15:19', '2026-06-18 19:17:34', 3, 0),
(155, 'Butter Chicken', 'Butter Chicken is an Indian-style dish prepared with tandoori chicken pieces simmered in a rich tomato cream sauce. It is a mild and velvety recipe suitable for all ages.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Butter Chicken. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Marinate chicken in yogurt, lemon juice, garam masala, chilli powder, turmeric, and salt for at least 2 hours. Grill or pan-fry the marinated chicken until lightly charred, then set aside. In a separate pan, melt butter and fry onion until golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Stir in tomato puree, cashew paste, coriander, cumin, garam masala, and chilli powder and cook for 10 minutes until the sauce is deep red and fragrant. Pour in cream and a little water and bring to a gentle simmer. Add the cooked chicken pieces and simmer for 15 minutes until the sauce is thick and the chicken is coated. Finish with a swirl of cream and garnish with fresh coriander. Serve Butter Chicken hot with naan or rice and enjoy.', 130, 40, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/9091b797-58a2-4947-9898-daa0a1440a02.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 15:49:32', '2026-06-23 18:57:30', 3, 0),
(156, 'Dal Tadka', 'Dal Tadka is an Indian-style dish prepared with cooked yellow lentils finished with a sizzling spiced ghee tempering. It is a comforting and aromatic recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Dal Tadka. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rinse and cook the yellow lentils in water with turmeric and salt in a pressure cooker for 4 whistles or boil for 30 minutes until completely soft. Mash lightly to a smooth consistency. Heat ghee in a small pan and add cumin seeds and let them splutter. Add chopped onion and fry until golden, then add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add chopped tomatoes and chilli powder and cook until the tomatoes break down and oil separates. Pour this tempering over the cooked dal and stir to combine. Simmer for 5 minutes and adjust consistency with water if needed. Finish with a squeeze of lemon juice and garnish with fresh coriander and another drizzle of ghee. Serve Dal Tadka hot with steamed rice or roti and enjoy.', 10, 35, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/50854f93-1009-4491-a4f8-d61803b913b7.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 15:55:38', '2026-06-23 18:58:02', 3, 0),
(157, 'Palak Paneer', 'Palak Paneer is an Indian-style dish prepared with cottage cheese cubes in a smooth spiced spinach gravy. It is a nutritious and vibrant recipe suitable for vegetarians.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Palak Paneer. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blanch fresh spinach in boiling water for 2 minutes, then transfer immediately to ice water. Drain and blend to a smooth puree. Lightly fry paneer cubes in oil until golden on all sides and set aside. In the same pan, heat oil and add cumin seeds. Add onion and fry until golden, then add ginger-garlic paste and green chilli and cook for 2 minutes. Add tomato and all dry spices and cook until the tomato breaks down. Pour in the spinach puree and stir to combine. Simmer for 5 minutes, then add cream and the fried paneer cubes. Simmer for another 5 minutes until the gravy coats the paneer. Season with salt and a pinch of nutmeg. Serve Palak Paneer hot with naan or rice and enjoy.', 15, 25, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/5f9d01c7-dfba-460f-8910-c08421c95a4f.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 15:59:49', '2026-06-23 18:57:59', 3, 0),
(158, 'Chicken Biryani', 'Chicken Biryani is an Indian-style dish prepared with marinated chicken and fragrant basmati rice layered and slow-cooked together. It is a majestic and aromatic recipe suitable for celebrations.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Chicken Biryani. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Marinate chicken with yogurt, ginger-garlic paste, chilli powder, garam masala, turmeric, and salt for 1 hour. Parboil soaked basmati rice with whole spices until 70 percent cooked and drain. Fry the marinated chicken in ghee in a heavy pot until half cooked. In a separate pan, fry onions in oil until deep golden and crispy. Layer the half-cooked rice over the chicken, scatter fried onions, saffron milk, fresh mint, and coriander over the top. Seal the pot with foil and a tight lid and cook on the lowest heat for 25 minutes. Rest for 10 minutes before gently mixing the layers. Serve Chicken Biryani hot with raita and enjoy.', 75, 55, 5, 'hard', '/images/recipes/eb4b3696-be0d-47c1-9385-83d84f6eae08.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:05:59', '2026-06-23 18:57:40', 3, 0),
(159, 'Samosa', 'Samosa is an Indian-style dish prepared with a crispy pastry shell filled with spiced potato and peas. It is a golden and savoury recipe suitable as a snack or starter.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Samosa. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Make the dough by mixing flour, ajwain seeds, salt, and oil, then adding enough water to form a firm dough. Rest for 30 minutes. For the filling, heat oil and fry cumin seeds, then add green chilli, ginger, boiled mashed potato, peas, coriander powder, garam masala, amchur powder, and salt and mix well. Cool the filling completely. Divide the dough into balls, roll each into an oval, cut in half, and shape each half into a cone. Fill with potato mixture and seal firmly with water. Deep-fry in batches at 160°C for 8–10 minutes until deeply golden and crispy all over. Drain and serve hot with green chutney and tamarind sauce. Serve Samosa hot and enjoy.', 45, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/ac3164b1-6481-406c-a4f8-22633cba39aa.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:10:38', '2026-06-23 18:58:15', 3, 0),
(160, 'Aloo Gobi', 'Aloo Gobi is an Indian-style dish prepared with potato and cauliflower stir-fried with dry spices. It is a simple and wholesome recipe suitable for an everyday vegetarian meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Aloo Gobi. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat oil in a wide pan and add cumin seeds and let them splutter. Add onion and fry until translucent, then add ginger-garlic paste and green chilli and cook for 1 minute. Add tomato and cook until soft. Add turmeric, coriander powder, cumin powder, and chilli powder and stir for 1 minute. Add potato cubes and stir to coat in the spices. Cook for 5 minutes, then add cauliflower florets and mix well. Cover and cook on low heat for 20 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the potatoes and cauliflower are fully cooked and lightly golden. Season with garam masala and salt. Garnish with fresh coriander. Serve Aloo Gobi hot with roti and enjoy.', 15, 30, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/20da0e83-6998-48ea-b15b-ff6e157fb2c2.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:14:42', '2026-06-23 18:57:21', 3, 0),
(161, 'Masala Chai', 'Masala Chai is an Indian-style beverage prepared with black tea, milk, and whole aromatic spices simmered together. It is a warming and fragrant recipe suitable for any time of day.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Masala Chai. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Lightly crush cardamom pods, cloves, black peppercorns, and cinnamon in a mortar. Bring water to a boil in a small saucepan and add the crushed spices and freshly grated ginger. Simmer for 3 minutes to infuse. Add the tea leaves or tea bags and simmer for another 2 minutes. Pour in milk and bring back to a near boil, stirring, then add sugar to taste. Strain into cups through a fine sieve. Serve Masala Chai hot and enjoy.', 5, 10, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/910da966-ac17-4609-b4da-41f103fbd1c4.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:18:13', '2026-06-23 18:57:18', 3, 0),
(162, 'Paneer Tikka', 'Paneer Tikka is an Indian-style dish prepared with marinated paneer cubes and vegetables grilled until charred. It is a smoky and tangy recipe suitable as a starter or snack.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Paneer Tikka. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Mix yogurt with ginger-garlic paste, besan, chilli powder, cumin, coriander, garam masala, turmeric, chaat masala, lemon juice, and salt to make the marinade. Add paneer cubes, capsicum, and onion pieces and toss to coat. Marinate for at least 1 hour. Thread onto skewers alternating paneer and vegetables. Grill in a preheated oven at 220°C or over a hot grill pan for 10–12 minutes, turning halfway, until charred at the edges. Brush with melted butter and sprinkle with chaat masala. Serve with mint chutney and sliced onion. Serve Paneer Tikka hot and enjoy.', 70, 15, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/c500db5b-7176-43d5-b80b-07c32408a7ff.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:24:09', '2026-06-23 18:58:10', 3, 0),
(163, 'Chole Bhature', 'Chole Bhature is an Indian-style dish prepared with spiced chickpea curry served alongside deep-fried puffed bread. It is a hearty and indulgent recipe suitable for a special breakfast or brunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Chole Bhature. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak dried chickpeas overnight and pressure cook until tender. In a pan, heat oil and fry bay leaf and whole spices. Add onion and fry until dark golden. Add ginger-garlic paste, tomatoes, and all dry spices including chilli powder, coriander, cumin, garam masala, and anardana and cook until the masala is thick and oil separates. Add the cooked chickpeas and a cup of the cooking liquid and simmer for 20 minutes until the curry is thick and dark. For the bhature, mix maida, semolina, yogurt, baking powder, and salt into a soft dough and rest for 30 minutes. Roll into ovals and deep-fry at 180°C until puffed and golden. Serve Chole Bhature hot together and enjoy.', 490, 50, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/3c486028-2c7a-4507-a450-2556579b1783.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:28:24', '2026-06-23 18:57:55', 3, 0),
(164, 'Dosa with Sambar', 'Dosa with Sambar is an Indian-style dish prepared with a crispy fermented rice and lentil crepe served with lentil vegetable stew. It is a light and tangy recipe suitable for breakfast.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Dosa with Sambar. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak rice and urad dal separately for 6 hours, grind to a smooth batter, combine, and ferment overnight. Season the batter with salt. For the sambar, pressure cook toor dal until soft. In a pan, fry mustard seeds, curry leaves, dried red chillies, and asafoetida in oil. Add onion, tomato, and mixed vegetables and cook for 5 minutes. Add tamarind water, sambar powder, and the cooked dal and simmer for 20 minutes. Heat a flat pan, pour a ladle of batter, and spread in circles to form a thin crepe. Drizzle oil around the edges and cook until the edges lift and the surface is golden. Fold and serve alongside the hot sambar and coconut chutney. Serve Dosa with Sambar hot and enjoy.', 900, 30, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/ff796b55-6900-4877-96c0-bfd122ad5a42.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:32:26', '2026-06-23 18:57:50', 3, 0),
(165, 'Lamb Rogan Josh', 'Lamb Rogan Josh is an Indian-style dish prepared with slow-braised lamb in a deep red Kashmiri spiced gravy. It is a bold and fragrant recipe suitable for a special dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Lamb Rogan Josh. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat ghee in a heavy pot and fry whole spices until they begin to crackle. Add onion and fry until dark golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Mix Kashmiri chilli powder with a little water to form a paste and add to the pot. Add lamb pieces and sear until browned. Stir in yogurt one tablespoon at a time to prevent splitting and cook after each addition. Add fennel powder, ginger powder, coriander, and garam masala. Pour in a little water, cover, and braise on low heat for 1.5 hours until the lamb is tender and the oil separates from the gravy. Garnish with fresh coriander. Serve Lamb Rogan Josh hot with naan or steamed rice and enjoy.', 15, 100, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/ad629327-da60-4d20-ad13-47b4546d82f8.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:36:07', '2026-06-23 18:57:43', 3, 0),
(166, 'Pani Puri', 'Pani Puri is an Indian-style street food prepared with hollow fried crisp shells filled with spiced potato and dunked in tangy mint water. It is a burst-in-the-mouth recipe suitable as a street snack.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pani Puri. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. For the puri, mix semolina, flour, and salt with enough water to form a stiff dough. Rest for 20 minutes, roll very thin, cut into small rounds, and deep-fry at 180°C until puffed and crispy. Drain and cool. For the pani, blend fresh mint, coriander, green chilli, ginger, tamarind, black salt, chaat masala, cumin powder, and cold water until smooth. Strain and chill. Mash boiled potato and chickpeas together with chaat masala, chilli powder, and salt. To serve, make a hole in each puri, fill with the potato mixture, and dunk completely in the chilled pani. Eat immediately. Serve Pani Puri immediately and enjoy.', 30, 20, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/ca0a2af3-1aac-47ad-8d6c-11679df44c75.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:42:55', '2026-06-23 18:57:24', 3, 0),
(167, 'Raita', 'Raita is an Indian-style condiment prepared with chilled yogurt, cucumber, and spices. It is a cooling and refreshing recipe suitable as an accompaniment to spicy Indian dishes.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Raita. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Grate or finely dice the cucumber and squeeze out excess moisture using a clean cloth. Whisk the yogurt until smooth and creamy. Add the cucumber, grated onion, chopped tomato, green chilli, and fresh mint and coriander leaves. Season with roasted cumin powder, chaat masala, black salt, and regular salt. Mix gently to combine. Chill in the refrigerator for at least 15 minutes. Sprinkle with a pinch of chilli powder and roasted cumin before serving. Serve Raita cold alongside biryani, kebabs, or curry and enjoy.', 15, 0, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/53f2d45e-640e-4070-bcc8-b063e9fd2c1a.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:50:24', '2026-06-23 18:57:01', 3, 0),
(168, 'Aloo Paratha', 'Aloo Paratha is an Indian-style dish prepared with whole wheat flatbread stuffed with spiced mashed potato filling. It is a hearty and filling recipe suitable for breakfast or lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Aloo Paratha. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Knead whole wheat flour with salt, a little oil, and enough water to form a soft smooth dough. Rest for 20 minutes. Mix boiled mashed potato with finely chopped onion, green chilli, ginger, fresh coriander, cumin seeds, garam masala, chilli powder, and salt. Divide the dough into balls. Roll each ball into a small disc, place a generous amount of filling in the centre, bring the edges up to enclose, and flatten gently. Roll out carefully into a thick round paratha. Cook on a hot griddle with ghee or butter, pressing gently, until both sides are golden with dark spots. Serve with butter, yogurt, and pickle. Serve Aloo Paratha hot and enjoy.', 30, 25, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/98c37b6b-31a4-43ba-879e-caaef7d35366.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 16:59:30', '2026-06-23 18:57:15', 3, 0),
(169, 'Chicken Tikka', 'Chicken Tikka is an Indian-style dish prepared with boneless chicken marinated in spiced yogurt and grilled until charred. It is a smoky and tangy recipe suitable as a starter or party dish.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Chicken Tikka. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Mix yogurt with ginger-garlic paste, lemon juice, Kashmiri chilli powder, garam masala, ground coriander, cumin, turmeric, chaat masala, and salt to form the marinade. Add chicken cubes and coat well. Marinate for at least 4 hours or overnight. Thread onto skewers and grill in a preheated oven at 230°C for 12–15 minutes, turning once halfway, until the chicken is charred at the edges and cooked through. Alternatively, cook on a hot grill pan. Baste with melted butter in the last 2 minutes. Serve with sliced onion, lemon wedges, and mint chutney. Serve Chicken Tikka hot and enjoy.', 250, 18, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/833ea365-0d4c-4662-a716-d42232937dda.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:10:41', '2026-06-23 18:57:11', 3, 0),
(170, 'Idli with Coconut Chutney', 'Idli with Coconut Chutney is an Indian-style dish prepared with steamed fermented rice cakes served with fresh coconut chutney. It is a light and soft recipe suitable for a healthy breakfast.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Idli with Coconut Chutney. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak rice and urad dal separately for 6 hours. Grind urad dal to a very smooth and fluffy batter and rice to a coarser texture. Combine both batters with salt and ferment overnight at room temperature. Grease idli moulds, fill each with the fermented batter, and steam for 12–14 minutes until a toothpick comes out clean. For the chutney, blend fresh grated coconut, roasted chana dal, green chilli, ginger, and salt with water to a smooth paste. Heat oil and add mustard seeds, urad dal, dried red chilli, and curry leaves for the tempering and pour over the chutney. Serve idlis hot with coconut chutney and sambar. Serve Idli with Coconut Chutney hot and enjoy.', 900, 20, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/a8a89be7-4799-41c9-87c6-3d4da9a0e536.png', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:16:15', '2026-06-23 18:57:33', 3, 0),
(171, 'Mango Lassi', 'Mango Lassi is an Indian-style drink prepared with fresh mango pulp, yogurt, and milk blended to a smooth and chilled beverage. It is a sweet and tropical recipe suitable for beating the heat.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Mango Lassi. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Peel ripe mangoes and cut the flesh into chunks, or use ready mango pulp. Place the mango, chilled yogurt, cold milk, sugar, and a pinch of cardamom powder into a blender. Blend on high speed for about 1 minute until completely smooth and frothy. Taste and adjust sweetness. Pour into tall glasses over ice cubes. Garnish with a sprinkle of cardamom powder, a few saffron strands soaked in warm milk, and a slice of mango on the rim. Serve Mango Lassi chilled immediately and enjoy.', 10, 0, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/f5011820-4940-4214-bbdd-3ac52ee0fd39.png', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:18:54', '2026-06-23 18:57:57', 3, 0),
(172, 'Gulab Jamun', 'Gulab Jamun is an Indian-style dessert prepared with soft milk solid dumplings soaked in fragrant rose and cardamom sugar syrup. It is a rich and indulgent recipe suitable for celebrations.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Gulab Jamun. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Make the sugar syrup by dissolving sugar in water over medium heat, adding cardamom pods and rose water, and simmering for 5 minutes. Set aside and keep warm. Mix khoya, paneer, maida, baking soda, and a little milk to form a soft smooth dough. Divide into small balls with no cracks. Deep-fry in oil at 140°C, stirring gently, for 8–10 minutes until they are an even deep golden brown throughout. Drain briefly and drop directly into the warm sugar syrup. Soak for at least 30 minutes until the gulab jamun are plump and have absorbed the syrup. Serve warm or at room temperature garnished with crushed pistachios. Serve Gulab Jamun warm and enjoy.', 20, 30, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/30dde56f-4800-4f73-a322-8527972b632c.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:22:51', '2026-06-23 18:57:46', 3, 0),
(173, 'Chana Masala', 'Chana Masala is an Indian-style dish prepared with spiced chickpeas in a tangy onion tomato gravy. It is a bold and robust recipe suitable for a vegetarian main course.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Chana Masala. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak chickpeas overnight and pressure cook until tender. In a pan, heat oil and add bay leaf and whole spices. Fry onion until dark golden, add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add chopped tomatoes and all dry spices including chana masala powder, chilli powder, coriander, cumin, and turmeric and cook until the oil separates. Add the cooked chickpeas along with some of the cooking liquid and simmer for 20 minutes until the gravy is thick and dark. Add amchur powder and garam masala at the end. Crush a few chickpeas against the side of the pan to thicken the gravy naturally. Garnish with fresh coriander and sliced ginger. Serve Chana Masala hot with bhatura or rice and enjoy.', 490, 40, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/e3100cb7-9075-41bb-821c-899869446b27.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:27:11', '2026-06-23 18:56:54', 3, 0),
(174, 'Fish Curry (Goan Style)', 'Fish Curry Goan Style is an Indian-style dish prepared with fish in a coconut and Kashmiri chilli gravy with kokum. It is a tangy and spicy recipe suitable for seafood lovers.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Fish Curry Goan Style. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend dried Kashmiri chillies, fresh grated coconut, garlic, ginger, coriander seeds, cumin, turmeric, and a little water into a very smooth paste. Heat oil in a clay pot or pan, fry onion until golden, then add the ground coconut paste and cook for 5 minutes. Add kokum or tamarind water and season with salt and sugar. Bring to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes until the oil begins to separate. Gently slide in the fish pieces and simmer for 10 minutes without stirring too much. Adjust sourness and salt. Serve Fish Curry Goan Style hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 20, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/7a104d7a-5ddd-44ef-bd51-a6ef6b558694.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:36:15', '2026-06-23 18:57:37', 3, 0);
INSERT INTO `recipes` (`recipe_id`, `title`, `description`, `instructions`, `prep_time`, `cook_time`, `servings`, `difficulty`, `image_url`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `is_duplicate_suspected`) VALUES
(175, 'Pav Bhaji', 'Pav Bhaji is an Indian-style street food prepared with a thick spiced vegetable mash served with buttered bread rolls. It is a bold and comforting recipe suitable as a hearty snack or meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Pav Bhaji. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Boil potato, cauliflower, peas, and carrot until soft, then mash coarsely. In a wide pan, heat butter and oil and fry onion and capsicum until softened. Add ginger-garlic paste, chopped tomatoes, and all spices including pav bhaji masala, chilli powder, coriander, and turmeric and cook until a thick paste forms. Add the mashed vegetables and mix well, adding water to adjust consistency. Mash further while cooking for 10 minutes until the bhaji is thick, smooth, and deeply coloured. Finish with extra butter and lemon juice. Toast the pav buns with butter on a griddle until golden. Serve bhaji topped with diced onion, lemon, and coriander alongside the toasted pav. Serve Pav Bhaji hot and enjoy.', 20, 35, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/337551c2-fbc7-44f7-97d0-41dfef1e10ef.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:40:38', '2026-06-23 18:57:05', 3, 0),
(176, 'Saag Aloo', 'Saag Aloo is an Indian-style dish prepared with spinach and potato cooked together with aromatic whole spices. It is a hearty and earthy recipe suitable for a vegetarian everyday meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Saag Aloo. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blanch spinach in boiling water for 2 minutes and roughly chop. Heat oil in a pan and add cumin seeds and mustard seeds. When they splutter, add onion and fry until golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and green chilli and cook for 2 minutes. Add diced potato and stir to coat in the spices. Add turmeric, chilli powder, coriander powder, and salt and mix. Add a splash of water, cover, and cook for 15 minutes until the potato is tender. Add the chopped spinach and garam masala and stir to combine. Cook uncovered for 5 minutes until the spinach is fully incorporated and any excess moisture evaporates. Serve Saag Aloo hot with roti and enjoy.', 15, 30, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/e931c158-0bcc-459b-9e92-e0d145c58ae4.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:44:15', '2026-06-23 18:56:50', 3, 0),
(177, 'Kheer', 'Kheer is an Indian-style dessert prepared with rice simmered slowly in sweetened milk with cardamom and saffron. It is a creamy and fragrant recipe suitable for festivals and celebrations.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Kheer. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rinse the rice and soak for 20 minutes. Bring full-fat milk to a boil in a heavy-bottomed pot, stirring frequently to prevent scorching. Add the soaked rice and cook on low heat, stirring every few minutes, for 45 minutes until the rice is very soft and the milk has thickened to a creamy consistency. Add sugar, cardamom powder, saffron soaked in warm milk, and rose water and stir to combine. Cook for another 5 minutes. Garnish with slivered almonds, pistachios, and raisins. Serve warm or chill for 2 hours and serve cold. Serve Kheer chilled or warm and enjoy.', 30, 60, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/cbd30c3e-f753-43ac-9f63-2c4a52285687.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:50:48', '2026-06-23 18:56:31', 3, 0),
(178, 'Vegetable Korma', 'Vegetable Korma is an Indian-style dish prepared with mixed vegetables in a mild cashew and coconut cream sauce. It is a rich and aromatic recipe suitable for vegetarians seeking a celebratory dish.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Vegetable Korma. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak cashews in warm water for 20 minutes, then blend with coconut milk to a smooth paste. Heat ghee in a pan and fry whole spices. Add onion and fry until golden, then add ginger-garlic paste and green chilli and cook for 2 minutes. Add the cashew coconut paste and cook for 5 minutes. Add coriander, cumin, garam masala, and a little water and stir. Add mixed vegetables including carrot, potato, peas, green beans, and cauliflower. Season with salt and sugar. Cover and cook on low heat for 20 minutes until the vegetables are tender and the sauce is thick and fragrant. Garnish with fresh coriander and cream. Serve Vegetable Korma hot with naan and enjoy.', 25, 35, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/1f6fd5a8-61f7-48bb-af42-f87cae7bc0c1.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:54:58', '2026-06-23 18:56:44', 3, 0),
(179, 'Tandoori Naan', 'Tandoori Naan is an Indian-style bread prepared with leavened dough baked in a hot oven until soft with charred bubbles. It is a pillowy and buttery recipe suitable for scooping up gravies and curries.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Tandoori Naan. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Dissolve yeast and sugar in warm water and let sit for 10 minutes until frothy. Mix flour, baking powder, salt, and yogurt in a bowl. Add the yeast mixture and enough milk to bring together into a soft dough. Knead for 8 minutes until smooth and elastic. Coat with oil and rest in a warm place for 1 hour until doubled in size. Knock back and divide into balls. Roll each ball into a teardrop shape. Brush one side with water and place wet-side down on a very hot baking stone or upside-down heavy tray in an oven preheated to 250°C. Bake for 4–5 minutes until puffed and charred. Brush immediately with melted butter and sprinkle with nigella seeds or garlic. Serve Tandoori Naan hot and enjoy.', 80, 15, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/875c2790-41a3-4849-8f4d-36bbfb658fef.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 17:58:23', '2026-06-23 18:56:28', 3, 0),
(180, 'Lamb Keema Matar', 'Keema Matar is an Indian-style dish prepared with spiced minced meat cooked with green peas in a dry masala. It is a robust and satisfying recipe suitable for a quick weeknight dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Keema Matar. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat oil in a pan and fry bay leaf and whole spices until fragrant. Add finely chopped onion and cook until dark golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add minced lamb and cook on high heat, breaking up lumps, until browned and dry. Add all dry spices including coriander, cumin, chilli powder, turmeric, and garam masala and stir to coat. Add tomatoes and cook until they break down. Add green peas and a splash of water. Cover and cook on low heat for 15 minutes. Adjust seasoning and finish with a squeeze of lemon juice and fresh coriander. Serve Keema Matar hot with roti or rice and enjoy.', 15, 35, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/dbf2f54b-6f79-4abc-9585-e8a7b696ccc2.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 18:02:03', '2026-06-23 18:56:41', 3, 0),
(181, 'Halwa Puri', 'Halwa Puri is an Indian-style dish prepared with semolina halwa served alongside deep-fried puffed bread. It is a sweet and indulgent recipe suitable for a festive breakfast.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Halwa Puri. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. For the halwa, heat ghee in a heavy pan and fry semolina on low heat, stirring constantly, for 10 minutes until it turns golden and fragrant. In a separate pot, dissolve sugar in water and bring to a boil. Gradually pour the hot syrup into the semolina while stirring vigorously to avoid lumps. Add cardamom powder and cook, stirring constantly, until the mixture leaves the sides of the pan and is thick and glossy. For the puri, knead whole wheat flour with salt and enough water to form a firm dough. Divide into balls, roll into small rounds, and deep-fry at 180°C until puffed and golden. Serve the halwa garnished with almonds and raisins alongside the hot puris. Serve Halwa Puri hot and enjoy.', 20, 30, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/51071bf8-844e-483e-b3d7-19c94a75953a.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-21 18:05:24', '2026-06-23 18:56:36', 3, 0),
(182, 'Prawn Masala', 'Prawn Masala is an Indian-style dish prepared with prawns cooked in a spiced onion tomato gravy. It is a quick and punchy recipe suitable for a seafood dinner.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Prawn Masala. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Marinate prawns with turmeric, chilli powder, and salt for 15 minutes. Heat oil and fry the prawns briefly for 1 minute per side until pink, then remove and set aside. In the same pan, fry onion until golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add chopped tomatoes and cook until the oil separates. Add coriander, cumin, chilli powder, garam masala, and turmeric and stir well. Return the prawns to the pan and toss to coat in the masala. Add a splash of water and simmer for 5 minutes until the gravy clings thickly to the prawns. Garnish with fresh coriander. Serve Prawn Masala hot with roti or rice and enjoy.', 20, 20, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/6474030f-2ae2-49be-9d22-d4bf83e133e3.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 18:08:33', '2026-06-23 18:58:05', 3, 0),
(183, 'Chicken Vindaloo', 'Vindaloo is an Indian-style dish prepared with pork or chicken in a fiery vinegar and Kashmiri chilli marinade. It is an intensely spiced and tangy recipe suitable for heat lovers.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Vindaloo. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend Kashmiri chillies, garlic, ginger, cumin seeds, mustard seeds, coriander seeds, peppercorns, cloves, cinnamon, turmeric, and malt vinegar into a fine paste. Marinate pork or chicken pieces in this paste with salt for at least 4 hours or overnight. Heat oil in a heavy pot and fry onion until dark golden. Add the marinated meat along with the marinade and sear on high heat. Add water and bring to a boil. Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 1 hour until the meat is very tender and the oil separates from the dark red gravy. Adjust sourness with more vinegar and season with salt and sugar. Serve Vindaloo hot with steamed rice and enjoy.', 250, 70, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/d7788c75-40ec-4ea9-bc36-50df39803aa6.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 18:14:13', '2026-06-23 18:56:39', 3, 0),
(184, 'Aloo Tikki', 'Aloo Tikki is an Indian-style street food prepared with crispy spiced potato patties shallow-fried until golden. It is a crunchy and satisfying recipe suitable as a snack or chaat base.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Aloo Tikki. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Boil potatoes until fully tender, peel, and mash until completely smooth with no lumps. Add chopped green chilli, grated ginger, coriander leaves, cumin seeds, chaat masala, garam masala, and salt and mix well. Add a tablespoon of cornstarch to help bind. Divide into balls and flatten into round patties. Heat a generous amount of oil on a flat pan over medium-high heat. Cook the patties for 3–4 minutes per side without moving until deeply golden and crispy. Serve topped with yogurt, green chutney, tamarind chutney, chopped onion, and a sprinkle of chaat masala. Serve Aloo Tikki hot and enjoy.', 20, 20, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/9eefec89-1ce6-43b6-93da-abf762795bda.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 18:18:05', '2026-06-23 18:58:17', 3, 0),
(185, 'Biryani Raita', 'Biryani Raita is an Indian-style condiment prepared with whisked yogurt, cucumber, and boondi pearls seasoned with spices. It is a cooling and tangy recipe suitable as an accompaniment to biryani.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Biryani Raita. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Whisk yogurt until completely smooth. Finely dice cucumber and gently squeeze out excess water. Soak boondi in water for 5 minutes to soften, then squeeze dry. Combine yogurt with cucumber, boondi, finely sliced onion, green chilli, and fresh mint. Season with roasted cumin powder, black salt, regular salt, and a pinch of chilli powder. Mix gently and chill for 15 minutes. Sprinkle with additional cumin and chilli powder before serving. Serve Biryani Raita cold alongside biryani or pulao and enjoy.', 15, 0, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/6d27b688-27db-43ab-b8f6-614e2c5f38e1.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 18:28:01', '2026-06-23 18:57:09', 3, 0),
(186, 'Dal Makhani', 'Dal Makhani is an Indian-style dish prepared with whole black lentils and kidney beans slow-cooked with butter and cream. It is a velvety and deeply flavoured recipe suitable for special occasions.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Dal Makhani. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak black lentils and kidney beans overnight and pressure cook together until completely soft. In a separate pan, heat butter and fry onion until golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add tomato puree and dry spices including chilli powder, coriander, cumin, and garam masala and cook for 10 minutes until the butter separates. Pour this masala into the cooked dal and mix well. Simmer on very low heat for 1 hour, stirring often to prevent sticking, until the dal is thick and creamy. Stir in cream and butter and cook for 5 more minutes. Season with salt. Garnish with a swirl of cream and fresh coriander. Serve Dal Makhani hot with naan and enjoy.', 490, 80, 5, 'medium', '/images/recipes/3a35fb13-b86d-403e-9674-ebf64ace3d8c.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-21 18:32:22', '2026-06-23 18:56:46', 3, 0),
(187, 'Bhindi Masala', 'Bhindi Masala is an Indian-style dish prepared with okra stir-fried with spiced onion and tomato. It is a crispy and tangy recipe suitable for an everyday vegetarian side dish.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Bhindi Masala. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Wash okra thoroughly and dry completely before cutting to prevent sliminess. Slice into 2 cm rounds. Heat oil in a wide pan over medium-high heat and fry the okra without stirring for 5 minutes until lightly crisped. Remove and set aside. In the same pan, fry onion until golden, then add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add chopped tomatoes, coriander powder, cumin powder, chilli powder, and turmeric and cook until the tomatoes break down. Return the okra to the pan and toss gently to coat in the masala. Sprinkle with amchur powder and garam masala and cook for 3 more minutes. Serve Bhindi Masala hot with roti and enjoy.', 10, 25, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/f9ee4075-9300-4398-8085-93672089b385.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-22 18:22:48', '2026-06-23 18:57:53', 3, 0),
(188, 'Mutton Korma', 'Mutton Korma is an Indian-style dish prepared with mutton braised in a rich cashew and yogurt sauce with whole spices. It is a luxurious and mildly spiced recipe suitable for weddings and celebrations.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Mutton Korma. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak cashews in warm water and blend with yogurt to a smooth paste. Heat ghee in a heavy pot and fry whole spices until fragrant. Add onion and fry until very deep golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add the cashew-yogurt paste one spoonful at a time, stirring constantly to prevent curdling. Add ground spices including coriander, cumin, and garam masala and cook for 5 minutes. Add the mutton pieces and coat thoroughly in the masala. Pour in a little water, cover tightly, and braise on very low heat for 1.5 hours until the mutton is fall-apart tender and the sauce is rich and thick. Garnish with fried onions, rose petals, and saffron. Serve Mutton Korma hot with naan and enjoy.', 20, 100, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/21b15f49-8401-438a-8da6-b2ab59c4067f.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-22 18:28:35', '2026-06-23 18:58:07', 3, 0),
(189, 'Jalebi', 'Jalebi is an Indian-style dessert prepared with fermented flour batter piped into spirals and deep-fried, then soaked in saffron sugar syrup. It is a crispy and syrupy recipe suitable for festivals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Jalebi. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Mix flour, besan, yogurt, and a pinch of turmeric with enough water to make a smooth flowing batter. Rest and ferment for at least 2 hours. Make the sugar syrup by dissolving sugar in water and simmering with saffron and cardamom until it reaches a one-thread consistency. Keep warm. Fill the batter into a squeeze bottle or cloth with a small hole. Heat oil in a wide pan to 170°C and pipe the batter in concentric circles to form jalebis. Fry for 2–3 minutes until crispy and golden. Transfer immediately into the warm syrup and soak for 1 minute. Remove and serve immediately while still crispy on the outside and syrupy within. Serve Jalebi hot and enjoy.', 130, 25, 4, 'hard', '/images/recipes/80f912ad-de5a-423b-9a6a-16932882cee9.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:14:55', '2026-06-23 18:58:13', 3, 0),
(190, 'Upma', 'Upma is an Indian-style dish prepared with roasted semolina cooked with vegetables and a mustard seed tempering. It is a light and savoury recipe suitable for breakfast.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Upma. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Dry roast semolina in a pan on medium heat, stirring constantly, for 5 minutes until lightly golden and fragrant. Set aside. Heat oil and ghee in a pan and add mustard seeds and let them splutter. Add curry leaves, dried red chilli, and cashews and fry until the cashews turn golden. Add green chilli, ginger, and onion and fry until softened. Add mixed vegetables and cook for 3 minutes. Pour in water and bring to a boil, then season with salt. Reduce heat and gradually add the roasted semolina, stirring quickly to prevent lumps. Stir vigorously, cover, and cook on low heat for 3 minutes until the upma is fluffy. Add lemon juice and garnish with fresh coriander and grated coconut. Serve Upma hot and enjoy.', 10, 20, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/714bc4aa-ee03-4eb9-b0e1-3e309e95964c.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:21:22', '2026-06-23 18:56:58', 3, 0),
(191, 'Chicken 65', 'Chicken 65 is an Indian-style dish prepared with deep-fried chicken in a spicy and tangy coating. It is a crispy and bold recipe suitable as a starter or bar snack.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Chicken 65. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Marinate chicken cubes with ginger-garlic paste, Kashmiri chilli powder, garam masala, coriander powder, cumin, turmeric, lemon juice, cornstarch, egg, and salt for at least 2 hours. Deep-fry the marinated chicken at 180°C in batches for 6–7 minutes until golden, crispy, and cooked through. Drain on paper towels. In a separate pan, heat a little oil and fry curry leaves, sliced green chilli, and garlic briefly. Add a dollop of yogurt, chilli sauce, and a squeeze of lemon and stir quickly over high heat. Toss the fried chicken in this tempering. Garnish with sliced red chilli and coriander. Serve Chicken 65 hot and enjoy.', 130, 20, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/e0ea48c0-0ce9-4fc0-b574-199846d8c57e.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:27:43', '2026-06-23 18:57:51', 3, 0),
(192, 'Rava Kesari', 'Rava Kesari is an Indian-style dessert prepared with semolina cooked in ghee with saffron, cardamom, and sugar. It is a golden and fragrant recipe suitable for South Indian festivals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Rava Kesari. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat ghee in a heavy pan and fry cashews and raisins until golden, then remove and set aside. In the same ghee, add semolina and roast on low heat, stirring constantly, for 8 minutes until lightly golden and nutty smelling. Meanwhile, bring water to a boil with saffron and a pinch of food colouring if using. Carefully pour the hot water into the roasted semolina while stirring vigorously to prevent lumps. Add sugar and cardamom powder and stir until the sugar dissolves and the mixture thickens and comes away from the sides of the pan. Add the remaining ghee in two additions and stir to incorporate. Garnish with fried cashews and raisins. Serve Rava Kesari warm and enjoy.', 10, 20, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/1430e575-5d48-41e3-ad67-114689bf7234.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:32:00', '2026-06-23 18:57:35', 3, 0),
(193, 'Tandoori Roti', 'Tandoori Roti is an Indian-style bread prepared with whole wheat dough baked directly on a very hot surface until puffed and speckled. It is a wholesome and smoky recipe suitable for everyday meals.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Tandoori Roti. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Mix whole wheat flour, salt, and a little oil in a bowl. Gradually add water and knead to form a soft smooth dough. Rest under a damp cloth for 20 minutes. Divide into small balls and roll each into a thin round disc. Preheat a cast iron pan or tava over very high heat. Place the roti on the hot surface and cook for 1 minute until bubbles appear. Flip and cook for another minute. Then using tongs, place directly over a gas flame for 20–30 seconds until it puffs up and develops char spots. Brush immediately with ghee or butter. Serve Tandoori Roti hot with curry or dal and enjoy.', 30, 20, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/8c5d9aed-0e2c-4982-9e84-cf3effdb9356.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:34:26', '2026-06-23 18:56:48', 3, 0),
(194, 'Egg Curry', 'Egg Curry is an Indian-style dish prepared with hard-boiled eggs simmered in a spiced onion tomato gravy. It is a simple and satisfying recipe suitable for a quick everyday meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Egg Curry. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Hard-boil eggs, peel, and score lightly with a knife. Shallow-fry the eggs in oil until golden on all sides, then set aside. In the same oil, fry onion until golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add chopped tomatoes and dry spices including coriander, cumin, chilli powder, turmeric, and garam masala and cook until the oil separates. Pour in water and bring to a simmer. Gently add the fried eggs and simmer for 10 minutes until the gravy is thick and coats the eggs. Season with salt and garnish with fresh coriander. Serve Egg Curry hot with rice or roti and enjoy.', 10, 25, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/c152453a-cf53-408e-b21e-545cd0d3a9dc.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:38:21', '2026-06-23 18:56:19', 3, 0),
(195, 'Poha', 'Poha is an Indian-style dish prepared with flattened rice flakes cooked with mustard seeds, onion, and peanuts. It is a light and savoury recipe suitable for a quick breakfast.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Poha. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Rinse flattened rice under cold water in a sieve until softened but not mushy. Drain and set aside. Heat oil in a pan and fry raw peanuts until golden, then remove and set aside. In the same pan, add mustard seeds and let them splutter. Add curry leaves, green chilli, and onion and fry until translucent. Add potato cubes, cover, and cook for 5 minutes until tender. Add turmeric powder and salt. Add the rinsed poha and toss gently to mix. Cover and cook on low heat for 3 minutes. Add a squeeze of lemon juice, the fried peanuts, and garnish with fresh coriander and grated coconut. Serve Poha hot and enjoy.', 10, 15, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/15cd40b2-3acb-4710-8878-5a97f4011da0.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:47:14', '2026-06-23 18:56:18', 3, 0),
(196, 'Seekh Kebab', 'Seekh Kebab is an Indian-style dish prepared with spiced minced lamb pressed onto skewers and grilled over charcoal. It is a smoky and aromatic recipe suitable for a barbecue or starter.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Seekh Kebab. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Combine minced lamb with ginger-garlic paste, finely chopped onion, green chilli, fresh coriander, roasted cumin powder, coriander powder, garam masala, chilli powder, and salt. Mix thoroughly and refrigerate for 30 minutes to firm up. Divide into portions and press firmly onto flat metal skewers in a long sausage shape. Grill over hot charcoal or under a preheated oven broiler for 12–15 minutes, rotating every few minutes, until nicely charred and cooked through. Slide off the skewers and brush with melted butter. Serve with sliced onion rings, lemon wedges, and mint chutney. Serve Seekh Kebab hot and enjoy.', 45, 20, 4, 'medium', '/images/recipes/1bcaf608-e79b-48ea-86bc-79606b2889f4.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-23 17:51:16', '2026-06-23 18:56:16', 3, 0),
(197, 'Coconut Chutney', 'Coconut Chutney is an Indian-style condiment prepared with fresh coconut, green chilli, and a mustard seed tempering. It is a cool and fragrant recipe suitable as an accompaniment to South Indian dishes.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Coconut Chutney. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Blend fresh grated coconut, roasted chana dal, green chilli, ginger, and salt with just enough cold water to form a smooth thick paste. Transfer to a serving bowl. Heat oil in a small pan and add mustard seeds and wait until they splutter. Add dried red chilli, curry leaves, and asafoetida and fry for 30 seconds. Pour the hot tempering directly over the chutney and mix lightly. Add a squeeze of lemon juice and stir. Adjust salt and consistency. Serve Coconut Chutney fresh alongside dosa, idli, or vada and enjoy.', 10, 3, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/a6484fbc-1e0c-4a0d-99e7-fff5cb6b790e.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 18:00:32', '2026-06-23 18:56:14', 3, 0),
(198, 'Aloo Matar', 'Aloo Matar is an Indian-style dish prepared with potato and green peas cooked in a spiced tomato gravy. It is a wholesome and comforting recipe suitable for a simple vegetarian meal.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Aloo Matar. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat oil in a pan and add cumin seeds until they splutter. Add onion and fry until golden, then add ginger-garlic paste and green chilli and cook for 2 minutes. Add tomatoes and all dry spices including coriander, cumin, chilli powder, turmeric, and garam masala and cook until the oil separates. Add diced potato and stir to coat. Add water, cover, and cook for 15 minutes. Add green peas and season with salt. Cover and cook for another 5 minutes until both potato and peas are fully cooked. Finish with a squeeze of lemon and garnish with fresh coriander. Serve Aloo Matar hot with roti and enjoy.', 10, 30, 3, 'easy', '/images/recipes/3ddff35a-62e5-49a8-acc2-cd9f20eaff93.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 18:06:49', '2026-06-23 18:56:21', 3, 0),
(199, 'Shahi Paneer', 'Shahi Paneer is an Indian-style dish prepared with paneer in a royal cashew, cream, and saffron gravy. It is an indulgent and aromatic recipe suitable for festive vegetarian dining.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Shahi Paneer. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak cashews in warm water and blend to a smooth paste. In a pan, heat ghee and fry cardamom, bay leaf, and cloves for 1 minute. Add onion puree and cook until dry and golden. Add ginger-garlic paste and cook for 2 minutes. Add the cashew paste, cream, and saffron milk and stir to combine. Add white pepper, garam masala, sugar, and salt and simmer for 10 minutes until the gravy is thick and creamy. Gently fold in paneer cubes and heat through. Garnish with a drizzle of cream and chopped pistachios. Serve Shahi Paneer hot with naan and enjoy.', 20, 25, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/aef64610-57e8-4f04-b77c-cf880cd0a281.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 18:13:28', '2026-06-23 18:56:56', 3, 0),
(200, 'Tamarind Chutney', 'Tamarind Chutney is an Indian-style condiment prepared with tamarind, jaggery, and spices cooked to a thick sauce. It is a sweet, sour, and spiced recipe suitable as a dipping sauce for chaat and snacks.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Tamarind Chutney. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Soak tamarind in hot water for 20 minutes and squeeze out all the pulp, discarding the seeds and fibres. In a saucepan, combine tamarind water, grated jaggery, and a splash of water and bring to a boil, stirring until the jaggery dissolves. Add roasted cumin powder, ginger powder, black salt, regular salt, chilli powder, and garam masala and stir to combine. Simmer on low heat for 15–20 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the chutney thickens to a coating consistency. Cool completely and store in a jar. Serve Tamarind Chutney at room temperature with samosa, pani puri, or chaat and enjoy.', 30, 20, 8, 'easy', '/images/recipes/7db2d68f-7f78-444c-ac23-e3d57fe836d1.webp', 'approved', '2026-06-23 18:42:41', '2026-06-23 18:56:25', 3, 0),
(201, 'Lamb Seekh Kebab Wrap', 'Lamb Seekh Kebab Wrap is an Indian-style dish prepared with minced lamb kebabs rolled in a flatbread with chutney and salad. It is a smoky and satisfying recipe suitable for a quick lunch.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Lamb Seekh Kebab Wrap. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Prepare minced lamb mixture with ginger-garlic paste, onion, fresh coriander, cumin, garam masala, chilli powder, and salt. Shape into oval kebabs and grill or pan-fry until cooked through and lightly charred. Warm roti or flatbread and spread mint chutney and a spoonful of raita over the surface. Place the kebabs in the centre and top with shredded lettuce, sliced cucumber, thinly sliced red onion, and tomato. Sprinkle with chaat masala and a squeeze of lemon. Roll up tightly and wrap the lower half in foil. Serve Lamb Seekh Kebab Wrap hot and enjoy.', 25, 15, 2, 'medium', '/images/recipes/ec718f5f-3f95-426d-9042-98c2b4b8a521.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 18:47:14', '2026-06-23 18:56:23', 3, 0),
(202, 'Suji Halwa', 'Suji Halwa is an Indian-style dessert prepared with semolina roasted in ghee and cooked in sugar syrup with cardamom. It is a warm and rich recipe suitable for prasad or festive occasions.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Suji Halwa. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Heat ghee in a heavy pan over medium heat and add semolina. Roast on low to medium heat, stirring constantly, for 10–12 minutes until the semolina turns a deep golden colour and smells nutty. Add cashews and raisins and fry for another 2 minutes. Meanwhile, heat water with sugar and cardamom until the sugar dissolves. Carefully pour the sugar syrup into the roasted semolina while stirring vigorously. Stir continuously until the mixture thickens and pulls away from the sides of the pan, about 5 minutes. Garnish with slivered almonds and pistachios. Serve Suji Halwa warm and enjoy.', 5, 20, 4, 'easy', '/images/recipes/5d5a69e8-9476-4aa1-ba3b-ff12cbb023ff.jpg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 18:49:42', '2026-06-23 18:57:07', 3, 0),
(203, 'Dhokla', 'Dhokla is an Indian-style dish prepared with steamed fermented chickpea flour batter tempered with mustard and curry leaves. It is a spongy and tangy recipe suitable for a light Gujarat-style snack.', 'Prepare all ingredients needed for Dhokla. Wash, cut, and measure them properly. Mix besan with yogurt, ginger-green chilli paste, turmeric, salt, oil, and a little water to form a smooth thick batter. Add lemon juice and fruit salt just before steaming and fold in gently to incorporate air. Pour into a greased tin and steam for 20–22 minutes until a toothpick comes out clean. Cool for 5 minutes and cut into squares. Heat oil in a small pan and add mustard seeds until they pop, then add curry leaves, green chilli, and sesame seeds and fry for 30 seconds. Add water and sugar and stir. Pour the tempering evenly over the dhokla. Garnish with fresh coriander and grated coconut. Serve Dhokla at room temperature and enjoy.', 10, 25, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/79675af2-4572-421f-9f1e-395ff4cf29f3.jpeg', 'approved', '2026-06-23 18:53:03', '2026-06-23 18:56:12', 3, 0),
(204, 'Peanut Sesame Noodles', 'A quick and savory noodle dish tossed in a rich peanut and sesame sauce. Simple to prepare and packed with flavour.', 'Boil wheat noodles until tender, then drain. In a bowl, mix crushed peanut, sesame oil, soy sauce, minced garlic, and sugar into a smooth sauce. Toss the noodles with the sauce until evenly coated. Garnish with sliced green pepper and serve.', 10, 10, 2, 'easy', '/images/recipes/42bb8621-71bc-4620-8014-90e357a43a0c.jpg', 'approved', '2026-09-03 13:43:11', '2026-09-03 13:44:12', 3, 0),
(205, 'Creamy Prawn Pasta', 'A rich and creamy pasta dish with succulent prawns, parmesan, and a velvety egg yolk sauce.', 'Cook spaghetti according to package directions. In a pan, sauté prawns in butter with minced garlic until pink. Pour in heavy cream and stir in grated parmesan cheese. Toss with spaghetti, remove from heat, and stir in egg yolks quickly. Season with salt and black pepper.', 10, 15, 2, 'medium', '/images/recipes/becd76be-1391-41fc-ac2b-e76353dd6f68.webp', 'approved', '2026-09-03 13:52:32', '2026-09-03 13:58:47', 3, 0),
(206, 'Coconut Fish Curry', 'A fragrant and mildly spiced fish curry simmered in creamy coconut milk. A comforting dish inspired by Southeast Asian cooking.', 'Sauté diced onion, minced garlic, and sliced ginger in cooking oil until softened. Add turmeric powder and chilli powder, stir for 30 seconds. Pour in coconut milk and water, bring to a gentle simmer. Add fish steaks and cook for 10 minutes until fish is flaky. Season with salt and serve with steamed rice.', 10, 20, 3, 'medium', '/images/recipes/cad5fed6-a017-4703-be51-615839954148.webp', 'approved', '2026-09-03 13:56:28', '2026-09-03 13:56:46', 3, 0),
(207, 'Seafood Quiche', 'A rich Western-style tart with a flaky pastry base, creamy egg custard, melted Gruyère, and a seafood filling of shrimp and flaked white fish. Savoury and indulgent, good for brunch or a light dinner.', 'Preheat oven to 180°C. Line a tart tin with the shortcrust pastry and blind-bake for 10 mins. Sauté the onion until soft, then lightly cook the shrimp and flaked white fish until just done. Let cool slightly. Whisk the eggs, heavy cream, salt, pepper, and nutmeg together. Spread the seafood and onion over the pastry base, top with Gruyère and parmesan, then pour the custard over. Sprinkle with chives and bake 30 mins until set and golden. Cool 10 mins before slicing.', 25, 40, 6, 'medium', '/images/recipes/d055b67c-68a2-4b38-87db-8a0d6783cdd4.jpg', 'pending', '2026-09-15 11:32:32', '2026-10-08 15:25:10', 3, 0);
